 lugha nyingi, ukiwa na anwani zilizotafsiriwa, data ya SEO na kibadilisha lugha. Hufanya kazi na kurasa unazounda hapa.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Sanifu kurasa moja kwa moja kwenye kihariri kwa vitalu vya haraka visivyoacha alama. Kila kitu unachounda kinatafsiriwa na Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s imeundwa na timu ile ile na inafanya kazi pamoja na programu-jalizi hii.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Kubali kuunganisha tovuti hii kwanza.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Weka barua pepe halali.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Kubali kutuma maelezo ya msaada kwanza.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Andika mada na ujumbe.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Weka anwani ya barua pepe ambayo usaidizi unaweza kujibu.','AI providers'=>'Watoa huduma za AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Waundaji wa ChatGPT. Chaguo bora kwa mambo mengi.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Waundaji wa Claude. Imara katika kuandika na kutoa hoja kwa umakini.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Mitindo ya Gemini kutoka Google. Ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya AI ya Ulaya yenye miundo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Modeli za gharama nafuu ambazo ni nzuri katika uandishi na msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja wa miundo kutoka kwa watoa huduma mbalimbali.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na modeli inayofanya kazi kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Jumla (hutumika wakati hakuna kilichowekwa mahususi zaidi)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Kodi na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayoyatumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Vifunguo vyako vimesimbwa kwa njia fiche kwenye hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — kamwe havitumwi kwetu.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hivyo unamlipa mtoa huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huna uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza nyingine baadaye.','Next'=>'Ifuatayo','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayooana na OpenAI, inayoishia na /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma itauomba.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au ufungue akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'ukurasa wa funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Unda ufunguo mpya na unakili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Ibandike hapa chini na ubonyeze "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji salio kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'Ongeza salio','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa unaishia na …%s — bandika mpya ili kuubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Kitufe (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na ujaribu','Providers'=>'Watoa huduma','Provider'=>'Mtoa huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu-jalizi: sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au weka ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Uingize tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho lilifaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho lilishindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Muundo gani wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaashiria pendekezo letu kwa kazi hiyo. Orodha hii inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, ikisomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi miundo','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Onyesha upya orodha za mifano kutoka kwa watoa huduma','Images'=>'Picha','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Unganisha OpenAI au Google Gemini ili kutengeneza picha.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Muundo mpya zaidi wa picha wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Utafutaji wa tovuti (vipachikaji)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter ili kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji ya tovuti yako.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Muundo mpya zaidi wa upachikaji wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Kubadilisha hii kutaunda upya faharasa ya utafutaji ya kila programu-jalizi inayoitumia.','best quality'=>'Ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini zaidi','fastest'=>'yenye kasi zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza kielelezo wewe mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Je, mtindo mpya umetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uanze kuutumia mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la modeli','Add model'=>'Ongeza kielelezo','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hivyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha upya programu-jalizi, au washa masasisho ya kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la kawaida tu la kupakua ndilo linalotumwa: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna chochote kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha imetiwa saini, na orodha inayoshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, na uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'Orodha mpya zaidi ilisakinishwa','already up to date'=>'imesasishwa tayari','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'Upakuaji umeshindwa katika ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Haikuweza kuwasiliana na Zinn Digital®; orodha ya sasa inaendelea kutumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma asiyejulikana.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Inakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Miundo imehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina kamili la kielelezo, kwa mfano kama lilivyoandikwa kwenye nyaraka za mtoa huduma.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s imeongezwa. Ichague chini ya "Muundo gani wa kutumia".','Model removed.'=>'Muundo umeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Masasisho ya kila siku yamezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imekaguliwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI ulihifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la mojawapo ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au weka ufunguo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Uingize tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijawekwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna kielelezo kilichochaguliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua kimoja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hatumiki na toleo hili la jalagi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI anayeweza kutengeneza picha aliyeunganishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa OpenAI au Google Gemini katika mipangilio ya AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kutengeneza picha. Chagua OpenAI au Google Gemini kwa ajili ya picha katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia modeli yoyote ya picha. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine wa picha.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI aliyeunganishwa anayeweza kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji. Ongeza ufunguo wa Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au OpenRouter kwenye mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia modeli yoyote ya kupachika (embedding). Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa utafutaji wa tovuti.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyu wa AI hawezi kuunda faharasa ya utafutaji. Unganisha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral au huduma inayolingana kwa ajili ya utafutaji wa tovuti.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inafikika kutoka kwa seva yako ya wavuti (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haipatikani kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa wako mtandaoni, huenda seva yako inazuia miunganisho inayotoka, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema kuwa akaunti yako haina salio au kiasi kilichosalia. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako kwenye akaunti yako nao, kisha ujaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako. Huenda umeandikwa vibaya, umebatilishwa au umekwisha muda wake. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s imekataa ombi hili la ufunguo wako. Huenda ufunguo hauna idhini ya kufikia muundo au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji kuthibitishwa.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Muundo wa "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka %2$s kwa ufunguo wako. Chagua muundo mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi mfano wa "%1$s". Chagua mfano mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au upandishe daraja mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inapunguza kasi ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutuma maombi. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au uongeze kikomo cha kasi yako nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inakabiliwa na matatizo hivi sasa (kukatika kwa huduma au kuelemewa kwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo lolote kwenye mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu ambayo hatukuweza kuitambua. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, wasiliana na usaidizi ukitumia maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa muundo ambao programu-jalizi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua muundo mwingine au wasiliana na usaidizi.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (inayoendana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo wa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma hajaorodhesha kielelezo chochote cha maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza kielelezo mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s imejibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Jukumu lako la mtumiaji haliruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha matumizi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza kwenye mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, mipaka na ruhusa za majukumu hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makadirio, zilizokokotolewa kutokana na bei zilizochapishwa; modeli isiyo na bei inayojulikana huhesabiwa kama sufuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Inatumika kwa','Model'=>'Muundo','Tokens in / out'=>'Tokeni zinazoingia / kutoka','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi cha kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kwa kutokuwa na kikomo. AI huacha kwa salio la mwezi pindi gharama ya makadirio inapofikia hapo.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi cha kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha tupu bila kikomo.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Usiweke alama yoyote ili kumruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vikomo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa vimehifadhiwa.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Hitilafu ya kiusalama, tafadhali pakia upya ukurasa na ujaribu tena.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Mipangilio ya jarida haipo. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Mipangilio ya jarida si sahihi. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Invalid email address.'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe si sahihi.','Please tick the box to agree before subscribing.'=>'Tafadhali weka alama kwenye kisanduku ili ukubali kabla ya kujiandikisha.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Majaribio mengi mno. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Hitilafu imetokea. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Map'=>'Ramani','Background video'=>'Video ya mandharinyuma','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: faili %2$d za fonti zimehifadhiwa, lahajedwali ya mtindo %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Familia hiyo haijahifadhiwa.','Removed.'=>'Imeondolewa.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Hili si jina sahihi la kundi la fonti.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts haikurudisha familia hiyo. Angalia jina na ujaribu tena.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faili za fonti hazikuweza kupakuliwa au kuhifadhiwa. Angalia ikiwa folda ya vipakizi inaweza kuandikika.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Laha ya mtindo wa fonti haikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Angalia ikiwa folda ya vipakizi inaweza kuandikwa.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Ondoa taarifa hii','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(hufunguka kwenye kichupo kipya)','Done:'=>'Imekamilika:','To do:'=>'Ya kufanya:','Glossary index'=>'Fahirisi ya kamusi istilahi','Rated %1$s out of %2$s'=>'Imekadiriwa %1$s kati ya %2$s','Progress'=>'Maendeleo','%s%%'=>'%s%%','Copy code'=>'Nakili msimbo','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','That widget is not available on this site.'=>'Wigi hiyo haipatikani kwenye tovuti hii.','Email'=>'Barua pepe','Phone'=>'Simu','RSS feed'=>'Mlisho wa RSS','Website'=>'Tovuti','Link'=>'Kiungo','%s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s (hufunguka kwenye kichupo kipya)','Rated %d out of 5'=>'Imekadiriwa %d kati ya 5','(recommended)'=>'(inapendekezwa)','Included'=>'Imejumuishwa','Not included'=>'Haikujumuishwa','Comparison table'=>'Jedwali la ulinganisho','Call %s'=>'Piga simu kwa %s','Email %s'=>'Barua pepe %s','Text %s'=>'Maandishi %s','Chat on WhatsApp'=>'Piga gumzo kupitia WhatsApp','Contact us'=>'Wasiliana nasi','Chat with us on WhatsApp'=>'Zungumza nasi kwenye WhatsApp','This form is not available right now.'=>'Fomu hii haipatikani kwa sasa.','This form cannot be shown because %s is not active.'=>'Fomu hii haiwezi kuonyeshwa kwa sababu %s haijakamilika au haitumiki.','Map: %s'=>'Ramani: %s','Showing the map loads it from OpenStreetMap.'=>'Kuonyesha ramani huipakia kutoka OpenStreetMap.','Show the map'=>'Onyesha ramani','Open the map on OpenStreetMap'=>'Fungua ramani kwenye OpenStreetMap','Booking calendar from %s'=>'Kalenda ya kuhifadhi kutoka %s','Showing the booking calendar loads it from %s.'=>'Kuonyesha kalenda ya kuhifadhi huipakia kutoka %s.','Show the booking calendar'=>'Onyesha kalenda ya uhifadhi','Book on %s'=>'Weka nafasi kwenye %s','QR code for %s'=>'Msimbo wa QR wa %s','Design'=>'Muundo','Content'=>'Maudhui','Media'=>'Midia','Marketing'=>'Uuzaji','Site'=>'Tovuti','Data'=>'Data','Affiliate & iGaming'=>'Washirika na iGaming','Related posts'=>'Machapisho yanayohusiana','Post details'=>'Maelezo ya chapisho','By'=>'Na','Published'=>'Imechapishwa','Updated'=>'Imesasishwa','In'=>'Ndani ya','Tagged'=>'Imetambulishwa','%d minute read'=>'Usomaji wa dakika %d' . "\0" . 'Usomaji wa dakika %d','No comments yet'=>'Bado hakuna maoni','%d comment'=>'Maoni %d' . "\0" . 'Maoni %d','Sitemap'=>'Ramani ya tovuti','(no title)'=>'(hakuna kichwa)','All posts by %s'=>'Machapisho yote ya %s','This content is protected. Enter the password to see it.'=>'Maudhui haya yamelindwa. Weka nenosiri ili uyaone.','That password is not right. Try again.'=>'Nenosiri hilo si sahihi. Jaribu tena.','Password'=>'Nenosiri','Show the content'=>'Onyesha maudhui','That page cannot be unlocked.'=>'Ukurasa huo hauwezi kufunguliwa.','Too many tries. Wait a few minutes and try again.'=>'Majaribio mengi mno. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena.','The password must be 4 to 200 characters long.'=>'Nenosiri lazima liwe na urefu wa herufi 4 hadi 200.','More'=>'Zaidi','Close'=>'Funga','Tab %d'=>'Kichupo %d','Contents'=>'Yaliyomo','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Hati za skrini ya msimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe tena kutoka kwa kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Lugha','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Mteja wa huduma ya upangishaji? Pata punguzo la %1$d%% kwa %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Kama mteja wa upangishaji wa Zinn Digital®, unapata msimbo wa kibinafsi wa punguzo la %d%% kwenye malipo yako ya kwanza. Ufanyaji upya ni kwa bei ya kawaida.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Pata nambari yangu ya %d%% na uende kulipa','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Punguzo hili ni kwa wateja walio na mpango wa kulipia wa upangishaji ulio katika hali nzuri. Majaribio ya bila malipo hayajumuishwi.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Tayari umetumia punguzo lako la mteja wa upangishaji kwa programu-jalizi hii.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Hatujaweza kupata msimbo wako sasa hivi. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe na herufi ndogo au nambari 1 hadi 8, kianze kwa herufi, na kisiwe jina la programu-jalizi.','The kit could not be read. Try again later.'=>'Seti haikuweza kusomwa. Jaribu tena baadaye.','This kit comes with Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Kifurushi hiki huja na Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','The kit library could not be reached. Check this site can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Maktaba ya vifaa haikuweza kufikiwa. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kuanzisha miunganisho ya kutoka, kisha ujaribu tena.','The kit library refused the request.'=>'Maktaba ya vifaa imekataa ombi.','Page Builder Sandwich sections'=>'Sehemu za Page Builder Sandwich','Ready-made sections from Page Builder Sandwich.'=>'Sehemu zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka Page Builder Sandwich.','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Casino Guide'=>'Mwongozo wa Kasino','This month\'s top-rated casinos'=>'Kasino zilizopewa alama za juu zaidi mwezi huu','Scores come from our own tests. Bonuses change often, so always read the terms on the casino\'s site.'=>'Alama zinatokana na majaribio yetu wenyewe. Bonasi hubadilika mara kwa mara, kwa hivyo soma masharti kwenye tovuti ya kasino kila wakati.','Top-rated casinos compared'=>'Kasino zilizopewa alama za juu zikilinganishwa','Royal Harbour'=>'Bandari ya Kifalme','Lucky Meadow'=>'Uwanja wa Nyasi wenye Bahati','Star Lantern'=>'Fanusi ya Nyota','Our score'=>