mabaka.','Garden tools'=>'Zana za bustani','What is worth buying and how to look after it.'=>'Kinachofaa kununuliwa na jinsi ya kukitunza.','Small gardens'=>'Bustani ndogo','Balconies, patios and containers.'=>'Balkoni, varanda na vyombo.','Practical guides to home gardening'=>'Miongozo ya vitendo ya ukulima wa bustani za nyumbani','Straightforward advice on growing vegetables, caring for lawns and choosing the right tools, written by people who garden every weekend.'=>'Ushauri wa moja kwa moja kuhusu kukuza mbogamboga, kutunza nyasi na kuchagua zana sahihi, ulioandikwa na watu wanaolima bustani kila wikendi.','Read the latest guides'=>'Soma miongozo ya hivi karibuni','About the author'=>'Kuhusu mwandishi','Estate Agency'=>'Wakala wa Majengo','What is your home worth?'=>'Nyumba yako ina thamani gani?','Book a free, no-obligation valuation.'=>'Weka nafasi ya tathmini ya bure bila masharti.','Book a valuation'=>'Weka miadi ya uthamini','Free valuation'=>'Tathmini ya bure','An agent visits and prices your home.'=>'Wakala anatembelea na kukadiria thamani ya nyumba yako.','Launch'=>'Zindua','Photos, floor plan and listing live within days.'=>'Picha, ramani ya sakafu na tangazo zitaanza kuonekana baada ya siku chache.','Sold'=>'Imeuzwa','We negotiate and manage the sale to completion.'=>'Tunajadili na kusimamia mauzo hadi yakamilike.','Bistro'=>'Bistro','Open Tuesday to Sunday'=>'Imefunguliwa Jumanne hadi Jumapili','Seasonal cooking, made for sharing'=>'Mapishi ya msimu, yaliyotengenezwa kwa ajili ya kushiriki','Local produce, a wood-fired oven and a wine list chosen by people who love it. Lunch and dinner, six days a week.'=>'Mazao ya asili, jiko la kuni na orodha ya mvinyo iliyochaguliwa na wanaouenzi. Chakula cha mchana na jioni, siku sita kwa wiki.','Book a table'=>'Weka meza','See the menu'=>'Tazama menyu','From our kitchen'=>'Kutoka jikoni mwetu','A short menu that changes with the seasons. Ask us about allergies: we are happy to adapt.'=>'Menyu fupi inayobadilika k