tiba za matukio kwa mbofyo mmoja.','Automations'=>'Otomatiki','Move tasks, assign owners and send reminders automatically.'=>'Hamisha majukumu, gawa wahusika na utume vikumbusho kiotomatiki.','Shared files'=>'Faili zilizoshirikiwa','Keep documents next to the work they belong to.'=>'Weka hati karibu na kazi inayohusika.','Reports'=>'Ripoti','Live dashboards for workload, progress and deadlines.'=>'Dashibodi za moja kwa moja za mzigo wa kazi, maendeleo na tarehe za mwisho.','Integrations'=>'Muunganisho','Connect the email, chat and storage tools you already use.'=>'Unganisha zana za barua pepe, gumzo na hifadhi ambazo tayari unatumia.','Security'=>'Usalama','Single sign-on, audit logs and encrypted data.'=>'Kuingia mara moja, kumbukumbu za ukaguzi na data iliyosimbwa kwa njia fiche.','14-day free trial, no card needed'=>'Jaribio la bila malipo la siku 14, hakuna kadi inayohitajika','Plan projects, not spreadsheets'=>'Panga miradi, si lahajedwali','One workspace for tasks, deadlines and files. Your team sees what matters today, and you see progress without asking for updates.'=>'Nafasi moja ya kazi kwa ajili ya majukumu, tarehe za mwisho na faili. Timu yako inaona kile kilicho muhimu leo, na wewe unaona maendeleo bila kuomba taarifa mpya.','Start free trial'=>'Anza jaribio la bure','See features'=>'Tazama vipengele','Up and running in minutes'=>'Tayari na inafanya kazi baada ya dakika chache','Create a workspace'=>'Unda nafasi ya kazi','Sign up and invite your team in minutes.'=>'Jisajili na ualike timu yako kwa dakika chache.','Import your work'=>'Ingiza kazi yako','Bring tasks in from a spreadsheet or another tool.'=>'Leta majukumu kutoka kwa lahajedwali au zana nyingine.','Get moving'=>'Anza kusonga','Templates and automations do the busywork.'=>'Violezo na michakato ya kiotomatiki hufanya kazi za kawaida zinazochosha.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri kipengee hiki.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Huruhusiwi kufanya hivi.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Hali salama ilizimwa kwa sababu hailingani tena na kuingia kwako. Pakia upya ukurasa.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Msimamizi pekee ndiye anayeweza kutumia modi salama.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji uingiaji wa kawaida wa kivinjari.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kusanidiwa.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji ufikiaji wa kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Ukurasa huo haupo, au umefutwa.','Sandwich Studio works with the block editor, and the block editor is switched off for this item. A plugin such as Classic Editor does that: allow the block editor for this item in its settings (Settings → Writing), then open Sandwich Studio again.'=>'Sandwich Studio inafanya kazi na kihariri cha vizuizi, na kihariri cha vizuizi kimezimwa kwa kipengee hiki. Programu-jalizi kama vile Classic Editor hufanya hivyo: ruhusu kihariri cha vizuizi kwa kipengee hiki katika mipangilio yake (Mipangilio → Kuandika), kisha ufungue tena Sandwich Studio.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Samahani, hauruhusiwi kuhariri kipengee hiki katika Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio haijajengwa. Sakinisha upya programu-jalizi.','Add title'=>'Weka kichwa cha habari','Type / to choose a block'=>'Andika / ili kuchagua kizuizi','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Inapakia Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio inahitaji JavaScript. Tumia kihariri cha kawaida badala yake.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri "%s" ukitumia Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri ukitumia Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Turubai tupu','Skip to content'=>'Ruka hadi kwenye maudhui','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Upana wa kompyuta kibao lazima uwe nambari kamili ya pikseli kutoka 480 hadi 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Upana wa simu ya mkononi lazima uwe nambari kamili ya pikseli, angalau 240 na ndogo kuliko upana wa kompyuta kibao.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila kituo maalum cha kusitisha kinahitaji kitambulisho chake chenyewe: herufi ndogo au nambari 2 hadi 12, kikianzia na herufi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Kikomo maalum cha kubadilika (breakpoint) hutumika iwe ni hadi upana fulani (pikseli 200 hadi 4000) au kuanzia upana fulani (pikseli 200 hadi 6000), na si zote mbili.','Tablet'=>'Kompyuta kibao','Mobile'=>'Simu ya mkononi','Site design'=>'Muundo wa tovuti','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Rangi, fonti na mitindo inayoshirikiwa na kila ukurasa wa tovuti na mandhari yako.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Mitindo ya jumla ya tovuti haikuweza kufunguliwa.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Fonti hiyo si mojawapo ya fonti za tovuti.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila rangi inahitaji jina la kipekee linaloundwa na herufi ndogo, tarakimu na alama za kistari.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Rangi "%s" si rangi sahihi ya CSS.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila fonti inahitaji jina la kipekee lililoundwa kwa herufi ndogo, tarakimu na alama za kistari.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Mlundikano wa fonti kwa ajili ya "%s" unaweza tu kuwa na majina ya fonti, alama za nukuu, koma na nafasi.','Uploaded icons'=>'Aikoni zilizopakiwa','Icon'=>'Aikoni','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Faili hii si aikoni ya SVG tunayoweza kutumia. Huenda imeharibika, au ilikuwa na maudhui pekee yaliyoondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama (hati, viungo, picha zilizopachikwa au fonti).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Aikoni haikuweza kufutwa.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia kuwezesha kusikoidhinishwa. Ili kumpa mtumiaji wako leseni, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali kagua barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako kisha utume tena fomu ya washirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Je, ungependa kuunganisha %1$s kuwa %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Amilisha Leseni','activate a license here'=>'wezesha leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kwenye barua pepe mara tu baada ya un