nformation.'=>'Asante kwa kutuma maombi ya kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na tutawasiliana nawe tukiwa na maelezo zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Kuki ya ufuatiliaji ya %s baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapoisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bila Malipo lakini HUTAKUWA na ufikiaji wa vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Pindi leseni yako itakapokwisha muda wake, hutaweza tena kutumia %s, isipokuwa ukiiwasha tena kwa leseni halali ya kulipia.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Bado unaweza kufurahia vipengele vyote vya %1$s lakini hutakuwa na ufikiaji wa masasisho ya usalama na vipengele vya %2$s, wala usaidizi.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Asante kwa kuboresha.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Baada ya %1$s yako ya bila malipo, lipa kiasi cha chini cha %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Kubali na Uwezeshe Leseni','I Agree - Change User'=>'Ninakubali - Badilisha Mtumiaji','All Requests'=>'Maombi Yote','All Types'=>'Aina Zote','allow'=>'Ruhusu','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Tayari umechagua kujiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuboresha %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Tayari umechagua kujiunga na ufuatiliaji wetu wa matumizi, ambao unatusaidia kuendelea kuiboresha.','Amount'=>'Kiasi','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Kila mwaka','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Kila mwaka','Anonymous feedback'=>'Maoni yasiyotajwa jina','as ap