a kuwezesha %s.','Country'=>'Nchi','Cron Type'=>'Aina ya Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Tunatumia maktaba ya PHP cURL kwa miito ya API, ambayo ni maktaba ya kawaida sana na mara nyingi husakinishwa na kuwezeshwa tangu mwanzo. Kwa bahati mbaya, cURL haijawezeshwa (au imelemazwa) kwenye seva yako.','data'=>'Data','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Hali ya utatuzi imewezeshwa kwa mafanikio na itazimwa kiotomatiki baada ya dakika 60. Unaweza pia kuizima mapema kwa kubofya kiungo cha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Tarehe','Deactivate'=>'Zima','Deactivate the free version'=>'Zima toleo la bure','Deactivate License'=>'Zima Leseni','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kulemaza leseni yako kutazuia vipengele vyote vya kulipia, lakini kutawezesha kuwezesha leseni kwenye tovuti nyingine. Je, una uhakika unataka kuendelea?','Deactivation'=>'Kulemaza','Yes - %s'=>'Ndiyo - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Wasilisha na %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kulemaza au kusanidua %s kutalemaza leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Ikiwa una muda mfupi, tafadhali tujulishe kwa nini una %s','Debug Log'=>'Kumbukumbu ya Utatuzi','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Utatuzi wa hitilafu','delegate'=>'Kaimisha','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Ukibofya, uamuzi huu utakabidhiwa kwa wasimamizi wa tovuti.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Kabidhi kwa Wasimamizi wa Tovuti','Delegate to Site Admins