u so much for using %s and its add-ons!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia %s na nyongeza zake!','Thank you so much for using our products!'=>'Asante sana kwa kutumia bidhaa zetu!','Thanks!'=>'Asante!','Welcome to %s! To get started, please enter your license key:'=>'Karibu kwenye %s! Ili kuanza, tafadhali weka ufunguo wako wa leseni:','Thanks, please wait'=>'Asante, tafadhali subiri','Thanks %s!'=>'Asante %s!','The following products\''=>'Ya bidhaa zifuatazo','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.the installation instructions'=>'maagizo ya usakinishaji','"The <product_label>", e.g.: "The plugin"The %s\'s'=>'Ya %s','Theme'=>'Mandhari','Theme Switch'=>'Badilisha Mandhari','Themes'=>'Mandhari','Themes page'=>'Ukurasa wa mandhari','This will allow %s to'=>'Hii itamruhusu %s','Timestamp'=>'Muhuri wa muda','Title'=>'Kichwa','Terms of Service'=>'Sheria na Masharti ya Huduma','Total'=>'Jumla','Town'=>'Mji','Seems like we are having some temporary issue with your trial cancellation. Please try again in few minutes.'=>'Inaonekana kuna tatizo la muda katika kughairi jaribio lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Your %s free trial was successfully cancelled.'=>'Jaribio lako la bila malipo la %s limeghairiwa kikamilifu.','It looks like you are not in trial mode anymore so there\'s nothing to cancel :)'=>'Inaonekana hauko tena katika hali ya majaribio kwa hivyo hakuna cha kughairi :)','Your free trial has expired. You can still continue using all our free features.'=>'Muda wako wa kujaribu bila malipo umekwisha. Bado unaweza kuendelea kutumia vipengele vyetu vyote vya bila malipo.','Your free trial has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Jaribio lako la bila malipo limeisha muda wake. %1$sBoresha sasa%2$s ili uendelee kutumia %3$s bila kukatizwa.','Plan %s do not exist, therefore, can\'t start a trial.'=>'Kifurushi cha %s hakipo, kwa hivyo, jaribio haliwezi kuanzishwa.','Your trial has been successfully started.'=>'Kipindi chako cha majaribio kimeanza kwa mafanikio.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Ulikwisha tumia jaribio hapo awali.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Unaonaje %1$s hadi sasa? Jaribu vipengele vyetu vyote vya kulipia vya %2$s kwa jaribio la bila malipo la siku %3$d.','Type'=>'Aina','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Haikuweza kuunganisha kwenye mfumo wa faili. Tafadhali thibitisha vitambulisho vyako.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Kulikuwa na hitilafu isiyotarajiwa ya API wakati wa kushughulikia ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache na ikiwa bado haifanyi kazi, wasiliana na mtunzi wa %s ukiwa na yafuatayo:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Hitilafu isiyotarajiwa, jaribu tena baada ya dakika 5. Hitilafu ikiendelea, tafadhali wasiliana na usaidizi.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kuondoa %s kutalemaza leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Kandrasi zisizo na kikomo.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Masasisho yasiyo na kikomo','verbUpdate'=>'Sasisha','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Je, ungependa kuendelea na sasisho?','Update'=>'Sasisha','Update License'=>'Sasisha Leseni','Upgrade'=>'Boresha','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Taarifa Muhimu ya Kuboresha:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Pakia na uwashe toleo lililopakuliwa','User Dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Mtumiaji','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Samahani, hatukuwez