tu kufanya yale ambayo akaunti yako ya WordPress inaruhusiwa kufanya, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote kutoka kwenye mipangilio ya AI agents (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s imejitambulisha kutoka %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s imejisajili kiotomatiki. Endelea tu ikiwa ulianzisha hii kutoka %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Akaunti yako haiwezi kutumia zana hizi kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Baada ya kujibu utarudi kwa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Ruhusu %s','Do not allow'=>'Usiruhusu','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Thamani inayohitajika haipo au ina muundo usio sahihi. Angalia muundo wa ingizo (input schema) wa uwezo.','The site refused the request.'=>'Tovuti ilikataa ombi hilo.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakala wa AI (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Ruhusu wasaidizi wa AI kama vile Claude, Cursor au VS Code wakufanyie kazi kwenye tovuti hii kupitia MCP (Model Context Protocol). Wanaingia kama mtumiaji wa WordPress (Claude na ChatGPT kwa kuwaidhinisha hapa, wengine kwa nenosiri la programu) na wanaweza tu kufanya kile ambacho mtumiaji huyo anaruhusiwa kufanya.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Mawakala wa AI wanahitaji WordPress 6.9 au toleo jipya zaidi. Sasisha WordPress ili kuwatumia.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Ruhusu maajenti wa AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Imezimwa: zana zilizo hapa chini na njia zake za REST hazijasajiliwa kabisa.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Anwani ya muunganisho (kikomo cha MCP)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude na ChatGPT: ingia badala yake','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ongeza anwani ya muunganisho kama kiunganishi maalum katika Claude, au kama programu katika hali ya msanidi programu wa ChatGPT. Zinafungua tovuti hii ili uweze kuziidhinisha; hakuna nenosiri la kunakili.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'Programu za AI zilizounganishwa kwenye akaunti yako:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Programu nyingine za AI: nenosiri la programu','Create an application password for your user'=>'Unda nenosiri la programu kwa ajili ya mtumiaji wako','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Ongeza hii kwenye mipangilio ya MCP ya programu yako ya AI, pamoja na jina lako la mtumiaji na nenosiri hilo:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: weka ingizo lile lile chini ya "servers" kwenye .vscode/mcp.json, na si chini ya "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Zana ambazo wakala wa AI anaweza kutumia hapa (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Mwongozo wa mtumiaji: Mawakala wa AI na MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Nyaraka za msanidi programu: uwezo, REST na MCP','Build and edit this site\'s pages from Page Builder Sandwich sections and website kits.'=>'Unda na uhariri kurasa za tovuti hii kutoka sehemu na vifaa vya tovuti vya Page Builder Sandwich.','Pages, sections and website kits.'=>'Kurasa, sehemu na vifaa vya tovuti.','List pages'=>'Orodhesha kurasa','Lists the pages you can edit, newest first, with an optional search.'=>'Huorodhesha kurasa unazoweza kuhariri, mpya zaidi kwanza, kukiwa na utafutaji wa hiari.','Words to search for in the title and content.'=>'Maneno ya kutafuta katika kichwa na maudhui.','Read a page'=>'Soma ukurasa','Returns a page\'s title, status, links and block content, and the sections (top-level blocks) it is made of.'=>'Hurejesha kichwa cha ukurasa, hali, viungo na maudhui ya kizuizi, na sehemu (vizuizi vya kiwango cha juu) ambazo ukurasa umeundwa nazo.','Create a page'=>'Unda ukurasa','Creates a page from sections (see pbs/list-sections) and/or block content. A new page is a draft unless another status is asked for.'=>'Hutengeneza ukurasa kutoka kwa sehemu (tazama pbs/list-sections) na/au maudhui ya kitalu. Ukurasa mpya ni rasimu isipokuwa hali nyingine iombwe.','Update a page'=>'Sasisha ukurasa','Changes a page\'s title, status or block content. Content you send replaces the page\'s content.'=>'Hubadilisha kichwa, hali au maudhui ya kizuizi cha ukurasa. Maudhui unayotuma hubadilisha maudhui ya ukurasa.','List sections'=>'Orodhesha sehemu','Lists the ready-made sections (hero, features, FAQ, testimonials, call to action and more) that can be added to a page.'=>'Huorodhesha sehemu zilizotayarishwa tayari (hero, vipengele, Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara, shuhuda, mwito wa kuchukua hatua na zaidi) ambazo zinaweza kuongezwa kwenye ukurasa.','Words to match in a section\'s name or keywords.'=>'Maneno ya kulinganisha katika jina la sehemu au maneno muhimu.','Add a section to a page'=>'Ongeza sehemu kwenye ukurasa','Adds a ready-made section to a page: at the start, at the end, or after the section at a given position.'=>'Huongeza sehemu iliyotengenezwa tayari kwenye ukurasa: mwanzoni, mwishoni, au baada ya sehemu iliyo katika nafasi maalum.','A section name from pbs/list-sections.'=>'Jina la sehemu kutoka pbs/list-sections.','With position "after": the 0-based position of the section to insert after.'=>'Pamoja na nafasi ya "after": nafasi yenye msingi wa 0 ya sehemu ya kuweka baada yake.','List website kits'=>'Orodhesha vifaa vya tovuti','Lists the website kits (a set of ready-made pages for one kind of business) this site can import.'=>'Hutoa orodha ya vifaa vya tovuti (seti ya kurasa zilizotengenezwa tayari kwa aina moja ya biashara) ambazo tovuti hii inaweza kuingiza.','Import a website kit'=>'Ingiza seti ya tovuti','Imports a website kit\'s pages (all of them, or the ones named), optionally publishing them, setting the home page and adding them to a menu. Importing again updates the same pages.'=>'Huingiza kurasa za kifurushi cha tovuti (zote, au zilizotajwa), kwa hiari ikizichapisha, ikiweka ukurasa wa nyumbani na kuziongeza kwenye menyu. Kuingiza tena husasisha kurasa hizo hizo.','List the builder blocks'=>'Orodhesha vizuizi vya kijenzi','Lists every Page Builder Sandwich block this site can use (Pro blocks too when Pro is active): name, title, category and description. Use pbs/get-block for a block\'s settings, then put the block in a page\'s content.'=>'Huorodhesha kila kizuizi cha Page Builder Sandwich ambacho tovuti hii inaweza kutumia (vizuizi vya Pro pia wakati Pro inafanya kazi): jina, kichwa, kitengo na maelezo. Tumia pbs/get-block kwa mipangilio ya kizuizi, kisha weka kizuizi hicho kwenye maudhui ya ukurasa.','Describe a builder block'=>'Eleza kizuizi cha mjenzi','Returns one block\'s settings (attributes with their types, choices and defaults), what it supports, which blocks it may contain, and a ready-to-use example in block markup.'=>'Hurejesha mipangilio ya kizuizi kimoja (sifa pamoja na aina zake, chaguo na chaguomsingi), kile inachotumia, vizuizi vinavyoweza kujumuishwa, na mfano ulio tayari kutumika katika uwekaji alama wa kizuizi.','Where the block is: its position among the page\'s sections, then among that block\'s inner blocks, and so on (0-based), as pbs/get-page lists them.'=>'Mahali kizuizi kilipo: nafasi yake kati ya sehemu za ukurasa, kisha kati ya vizuizi vya ndani vya kizuizi hicho, na kadhalika (kuanzia 0), kama vile pbs/get-page inavyoviorodhesha.','Change one block\'s settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya kizuizi kimoja','Changes the settings (attributes) of one block inside a page, found by its path; attributes you send are merged over the current ones. Works on blocks the site renders from their settings; for a block whose HTML is saved in the page, send new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'Hubadilisha mipangilio (sifa) ya kizuizi kimoja ndani ya ukurasa, kilichopatikana kwa njia yake; sifa unazotuma huunganishwa juu ya zile za sasa. Hufanya kazi kwenye vizuizi ambavyo tovuti huonyesha kutoka kwa mipangilio yake; kwa kizuizi ambacho HTML yake imehifadhiwa kwenye ukurasa, tuma alama mpya ukitumia pbs/update-page.','Remove a block from a page'=>'Ondoa kizuizi kwenye ukurasa','Removes one block (a whole section, or a block inside one) from a page, found by its path. The page\'s previous version stays in its revisions.'=>'Huondoa kizuizi kimoja (sehemu nzima, au kizuizi ndani yake) kutoka kwenye ukurasa, kilichopatikana kwa njia yake. Toleo lililotangulia la ukurasa hubaki katika masahihisho yake.','Move a section'=>'Sogeza sehemu','Moves a section of a page from one position to another (0-based, as pbs/get-page lists them).'=>'Hushusha au hupandisha sehemu ya ukurasa kutoka nafasi moja hadi nyingine (ikizingatia 0, kama pbs/get-page inavyoorodhesha).','Duplicate a page'=>'Nakili ukurasa','Copies a page (its title, content and template) into a new draft.'=>'Hunakili ukurasa (kichwa chake, maudhui na kiolezo) hadi rasimu mpya.','Move a page to the trash'=>'Hamisha ukurasa kwenye jalala','Moves a page to the trash. It can be restored from Pages, Trash for 30 days.'=>'Hupeleka ukurasa kwenye jalala. Unaweza kurejeshwa kutoka Kurasa, Jalala kwa siku 30.','Build a landing page'=>'Unda ukurasa wa kutua','A guided workflow: the agent picks sections that fit your business, builds the page as a draft and writes its text.'=>'Mtiririko wa kazi unaoongozwa: wakala huteua sehemu zinazofaa biashara yako, hutengeneza ukurasa kama rasimu na kuandika matini yake.','The business, its offer and its audience.'=>'Biashara, toleo lake na hadhira yake.','A page can be a draft, pending review, published or private.'=>'Ukurasa unaweza kuwa rasimu, unayosubiri uhakiki, iliyochapishwa au ya faragha.','Give the page a title.'=>'Ipe ukurasa kichwa cha habari.','%s saves its HTML in the page, so its settings cannot be changed on their own. Send the page\'s new markup with pbs/update-page.'=>'%s huhifadhi HTML yake kwenye ukurasa, kwa hivyo mipangilio yake haiwezi kubadilishwa yenyewe. Tuma markup mpya ya ukurasa ukitumia pbs/update-page.','%s (copy)'=>'%s (nakala)','The page could not be moved to the trash.'=>'Ukurasa haukuweza kuhamishwa hadi kwenye jalala.','Build a landing page on this WordPress site for: %s. Steps: 1) call pbs-list-sections and choose 4 to 6 sections in a sensible order (hero first, a call to action last); 2) call pbs-create-page with a title and those sections, as a draft; 3) call pbs-get-page and rewrite every piece of placeholder text for this business with pbs-update-page (keep every block comment and tag as it is); 4) if pbs-generate-page is available, you may use it instead of steps 1 to 3; 5) report the page\'s edit link and do not publish it without asking.'=>'Unda ukurasa wa kutua kwenye tovuti hii ya WordPress kwa ajili ya: %s. Hatua: 1) ita pbs-list-sections na uchague sehemu 4 hadi 6 katika mpangilio unaofaa (hero kwanza, wito wa kuchukua hatua mwisho); 2) ita pbs-create-page ikiwa na kichwa na sehemu hizo, kama rasimu; 3) ita pbs-get-page na uandike upya kila sehemu ya maandishi ya kishikilia nafasi kwa ajili ya biashara hii kwa kutumia pbs-update-page (weka kila maoni ya kizuizi na lebo kama ilivyo); 4) ikiwa pbs-generate-page inapatikana, unaweza kuitumia badala ya hatua 1 hadi 3; 5) ripoti kiungo cha kuhariri ukurasa na usiuchapishe bila kuuliza.','There is no block at that position. Read the page with pbs/get-page first.'=>'Hakuna kizuizi katika nafasi hiyo. Soma ukurasa kwa pbs/get-page kwanza.','There is no block called "%s". See pbs/list-blocks.'=>'Hakuna kizuizi kinachoitwa "%s". Tazama pbs/list-blocks.','The page has no section at that position.'=>'Ukurasa hauna sehemu katika nafasi hiyo.','That is not a kit name. See pbs/list-kits.'=>'Hili si jina la vifaa. Tazama pbs/list-kits.','There is no section called "%s". See pbs/list-sections.'=>'Hakuna sehemu inayoitwa "%s". Tazama pbs/list-sections.','Section names from pbs/list-sections, in page order. They come before any content given.'=>'Majina ya sehemu kutoka pbs/list-sections, kwa mpangilio wa ukurasa. Yanakuja kabla ya maudhui yoyote yaliyotolewa.','Block markup (the format the block editor saves).'=>'Uwekaji alama wa kizuizi (muundo ambao mhariri wa vizuizi huhifadhi).','There is no page with that ID.'=>'Hakuna ukurasa wenye kitambulisho hicho.','You are not allowed to do that to this page.'=>'Huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo kwenye ukurasa huu.','Connect Adobe Fonts (Pro)'=>'Unganisha Adobe Fonts (Pro)','Connects an Adobe Fonts (Typekit) web project by its kit id, so its fonts appear in the font pickers.'=>'Inaunganisha mradi wa wavuti wa Adobe Fonts (Typekit) kwa kit id yake, ili fonti zake zionekane kwenye viteuzi vya fonti.','Change the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Badilisha seti ya chapa (Pro)','Saves the brand kit: name, logo, colours, heading and body fonts, and the brand voice AI writing uses.'=>'Huhifadhi seti ya chapa: jina, nembo, rangi, fonti za vichwa na matini, na sauti ya chapa inayotumiwa na uandishi wa AI.','Apply the brand kit (Pro)'=>'Tumia vifaa vya chapa (Pro)','Applies the saved brand kit\'s colours and fonts to the site design.'=>'Huweka rangi na fonti za seti ya chapa iliyohifadhiwa kwenye muundo wa tovuti.','Read the responsive breakpoints'=>'Soma vituo vya kuitikia','Returns the tablet and mobile widths (and custom breakpoints in Pro) the responsive controls use.'=>'Hurejesha upana wa tableti na simu (na sehemu maalum za kukatiza katika Pro) unaotumiwa na vidhibiti vinavyojibu.','Change the responsive breakpoints'=>'Badilisha vituo vya kusimama vinavyobadilika','Changes the tablet and mobile widths in pixels; with Pro, custom extra breakpoints.'=>'Hubadilisha upana wa kompyuta kibao na simu katika pikseli; ukiwa na Pro, sehemu za ziada za kukatiza zilizobinafsishwa.','Create a global class (Pro)'=>'Unda darasa la jumla (Pro)','Creates a reusable global style class: label, slug and its styles (s).'=>'Hutengeneza tabaka la mtindo wa kimataifa linaloweza kutumika tena: lebo, slug na mitindo yake.','Delete a global class (Pro)'=>'Futa darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Deletes a global class. Elements that used it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Hufuta darasa la kimataifa. Vipengele vilivyoitumia huhifadhi maudhui yake na kupoteza mitindo yake.','Change a global class (Pro)'=>'Badilisha darasa la kimataifa (Pro)','Changes a global class\'s label, slug or styles; every element using it updates.'=>'Hubadilisha lebo, slug au mitindo ya darasa la jumla; kila kipengele kinacholitumia husasishwa.','Duplicate a global class (Pro)'=>'Nakili darasa la jumla (Pro)','Copies a global class under a new id.'=>'Hunakili darasa la jumla chini ya id mpya.','Turn on an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Washa fonti iliyopakiwa (Pro)','Makes an uploaded custom font (a font file in the media library, by id) available in the font pickers.'=>'Hufanya fonti maalum iliyopakiwa (faili ya fonti kwenye maktaba ya vyombo vya habari, kwa id) ipatikane kwenye vichaguzi vya fonti.','Turn off an uploaded font (Pro)'=>'Zima fonti iliyopakiwa (Pro)','Removes a custom font (by slug) from the font pickers.'=>'Huondoa fonti maalum (kwa slug) kutoka kwa viteuzi vya fonti.','Change dark mode (Pro)'=>'Badilisha hali ya giza (Pro)','Sets dark mode (mode: off, auto or toggle) and its colours.'=>'Huweka hali ya giza (hali: imezimwa, kiotomatiki au swichi) na rangi zake.','Read the site design'=>'Soma muundo wa tovuti','Returns the site-wide colours and fonts (heading and body) every block uses, as the Site design screen shows them.'=>'Hurejesha rangi na fonti za tovuti nzima (kichwa cha habari na sehemu kuu) ambazo kila kizuizi kinatumia, kama skrini ya usanifu wa tovuti inavyozionyesha.','Change the site design'=>'Badilisha muundo wa tovuti','Changes the site-wide colours (colors), fonts (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Every page picks the change up; the theme\'s theme.json is kept in sync.'=>'Hubadilisha rangi za tovuti nzima (colors), fonti (fonts, headingFont, bodyFont). Kila ukurasa unachukua mabadiliko; theme.json ya mandhari huwekwa katika usawazishaji.','Read the design system (Pro)'=>'Soma mfumo wa usanifu (Pro)','Returns the Pro design system: global classes, variables, design tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts.'=>'Hurejesha mfumo wa usanifu wa Pro: madarasa ya kimataifa, vibadala, tokeni za usanifu, hali ya giza, vifaa vya chapa na fonti maalum.','Change the design tokens (Pro)'=>'Badilisha tokeni za usanifu (Pro)','Changes the spacing, radius and shadow scales (space, radius, shadow), or resets them (reset).'=>'Hubadilisha vipimo vya nafasi, nusudipenyo na kivuli (space, radius, shadow), au kuviweka upya (reset).','Change the CSS variables (Pro)'=>'Badilisha viambishi vya CSS (Pro)','Replaces the site\'s design variables (variables: a list of name and value).'=>'Huweka upya vigezo vya muundo wa tovuti (vigezo: orodha ya jina na thamani).','List the dynamic content sources (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha vyanzo vya maudhui yanayobadilika (Pro)','Returns what a block can be filled from (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) with each source\'s fields, the field plugins on this site (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) and a post type\'s fields (postType). Bind a block with pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.'=>'Hurejesha kile ambacho kizuizi kinaweza kujazwa nacho (post, author, site, archive, custom field, product) pamoja na sehemu za kila chanzo, programu-jalizi za sehemu kwenye tovuti hii (ACF, Meta Box, Pods, JetEngine, Toolset, post meta) na sehemu za aina ya chapisho (postType). Funga kizuizi kwa pbs/update-block: attributes.metadata.bindings.<attribute> = {source, args}.','Preview a dynamic value (Pro)'=>'Kagua thamani inayobadilika (Pro)','Returns what a binding shows on one post (post, source, and field or provider + key, as text|url), to check a binding before or after adding it.'=>'Hurejesha kile ambacho ufunganishaji unaonyesha kwenye chapisho moja (post, source, na field au provider + key, kama text|url), ili kuangalia ufunganishaji kabla au baada ya kuuongeza.','Remove a self-hosted font'=>'Ondoa fonti inayojihifadhi','Deletes a self-hosted font family\'s files.'=>'Hufuta faili za jamii ya fonti inayojipangisha.','List self-hosted fonts'=>'Orodhesha fonti zinazojiendesha zenyewe','Lists the Google fonts this site hosts itself (downloaded once, served from the site, no request to Google).'=>'Huorodhesha fonti za Google ambazo tovuti hii inazihifadhi yenyewe (zinapakuliwa mara moja, zikitolewa kutoka kwenye tovuti, hakuna ombi kwa Google).','Self-host a font'=>'Jihudumie fonti','Downloads a Google font family (family, weights, italic) and serves it from this site.'=>'Hupakua familia ya fonti ya Google (familia, unene, italiki) na kuitumikia kutoka kwa tovuti hii.','List forms'=>'Orodhesha fomu','Lists the forms built with the Form block and the form plugins it can embed.'=>'Huorodhesha fomu zilizoundwa kwa kizuizi cha Fomu na programu-jalizi za fomu inayoweza kupachika.','List uploaded icons'=>'Orodhesha aikoni zilizopakiwa','Lists the SVG icons uploaded to the icon library, newest first.'=>'Huorodhesha aikoni za SVG zilizopakiwa kwenye maktaba ya aikoni, mpya zaidi kwanza.','Upload an icon'=>'Pakia aikoni','Adds an SVG icon (name, svg markup) to the icon library; the SVG is sanitised first.'=>'Inaongeza aikoni ya SVG (jina, muundo wa svg) kwenye maktaba ya aikoni; SVG husafishwa kwanza.','Delete an uploaded icon'=>'Futa ikoni iliyopakiwa','Removes an uploaded icon; blocks that used it keep their own copy.'=>'Huondoa aikoni iliyopakiwa; vizuizi vilivyoitumia huhifadhi nakala yake.','Read the licence'=>'Soma leseni','Returns this site\'s Page Builder Sandwich plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Hurejesha mpango wa Page Builder Sandwich wa tovuti hii, hali ya leseni, tarehe ya kusasisha na kile ambacho mpango unajumuisha.','Disconnect from support'=>'Tenganisha kutoka kwa usaidizi','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Hukata muunganisho wa tovuti hii kutoka kwa usaidizi.','Read the support connection'=>'Soma muunganisho wa usaidizi','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Hueleza ikiwa tovuti hii imeunganishwa kwenye usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®, na kama nani.','Connect to support'=>'Unganisha kwenye usaidizi','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Inaunganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® (jina, barua pepe, idhini).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Idhini utambuzi wa usaidizi','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Hurekodi idhini ya msimamizi ya kutuma uchunguzi pamoja na tiketi za msaada.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Soma uchunguzi wa tovuti','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Hurejesha uchunguzi ambao tikiti ya usaidizi ingekuwa nayo: matoleo, programu-jalizi amilifu, mipaka na makosa ya hivi karibuni.','Open a support ticket'=>'Fungua tiketi ya usaidizi','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email), with this site\'s diagnostics when the administrator agreed. It never creates a login or sends one.'=>'Hutuma tiketi ya msaada (mada, ujumbe, aina, barua pepe), pamoja na uchunguzi wa tovuti hii wakati msimamizi amekubali. Kamwe haitengenezi kitambulisho cha kuingia wala kukituma.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Anza jaribio la bure la Pro','Starts the 14-day Page Builder Sandwich Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Huanzisha jaribio la siku 14 la Page Builder Sandwich Pro kwa tovuti hii (hakuna malipo yanayohitajika).','Read the cloud library account (Pro)'=>'Soma akaunti ya maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Returns the cloud library\'s storage use, plan quota and team facts.'=>'Hurejesha matumizi ya hifadhi ya maktaba ya wingu, mgawo wa mpango na maelezo ya timu.','List cloud library designs (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha miundo ya maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Lists the designs saved to the cloud library (kind: section, page or pattern; team: a team\'s library).'=>'Huorodhesha miundo iliyohifadhiwa kwenye maktaba ya wingu (aina: sehemu, ukurasa au kiolezo; timu: maktaba ya timu).','Save a design to the cloud library (Pro)'=>'Hifadhi muundo kwenye maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Saves block markup (title, kind, markup, styles, tags) to your cloud library or a team\'s; images are packed with it.'=>'Huhifadhi alama ya kizuizi (kichwa, aina, alama, mitindo, lebo) kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu au ya timu; picha huwekwa pamoja nayo.','Delete a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Futa muundo wa maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Deletes a design from the cloud library.'=>'Hufuta muundo kutoka kwenye maktaba ya wingu.','Get a cloud library design (Pro)'=>'Pata muundo wa maktaba ya wingu (Pro)','Returns one saved design, ready to insert on this site (its images brought into the media library).'=>'Hurejesha muundo mmoja uliohifadhiwa, ulio tayari kuingizwa kwenye tovuti hii (picha zake zimeletwa kwenye maktaba ya midia).','Leave a team (Pro)'=>'Ondoka kwenye timu (Pro)','Leaves the team library this site joined.'=>'Huondoka kwenye maktaba ya timu ambayo tovuti hii ilijiunga nayo.','Join a team (Pro)'=>'Jiunge na timu (Pro)','Joins a team library with an invite code.'=>'Hujiunga na maktaba ya timu kwa kutumia msimbo wa mwaliko.','Stop using your own storage (Pro)'=>'Acha kutumia hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Removes the bring-your-own storage settings; the plan storage is used again.'=>'Huondoa mipangilio ya hifadhi yako binafsi; hifadhi ya mpango itatumika tena.','Read the own-storage settings (Pro)'=>'Soma mipangilio ya hifadhi binafsi (Pro)','Returns the bring-your-own R2/S3 storage settings (the secret is never returned).'=>'Hurejesha mipangilio ya hifadhi yako binafsi ya R2/S3 (siri hairejeshwi kamwe).','Use your own storage (Pro)'=>'Tumia hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Saves bring-your-own storage: provider (r2 or s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.'=>'Huhifadhi hifadhi yako binafsi: provider (r2 au s3), bucket, region, endpoint, prefix, key_id, secret, enabled.','Test your own storage (Pro)'=>'Jaribu hifadhi yako mwenyewe (Pro)','Writes, reads and deletes a test object in your own storage and reports each step.'=>'Huandika, husoma na kufuta kitu cha jaribio katika hifadhi yako mwenyewe na kuripoti kila hatua.','List library teams (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha timu za maktaba (Pro)','Lists the teams this site belongs to or owns.'=>'Huorodhesha timu ambazo tovuti hii inashiriki au inamiliki.','Create a library team (Agency)'=>'Unda timu ya maktaba (Wakala)','Creates a team library (name) that other sites can join with an invite code.'=>'Hutengeneza maktaba ya timu (jina) ambayo tovuti nyingine zinaweza kujiunga nazo kwa kutumia msimbo wa mwaliko.','Delete a library team (Agency)'=>'Futa timu ya maktaba (Wakala)','Deletes a team and every design in its library.'=>'Hufuta timu na kila muundo katika maktaba yake.','Invite a site to a team (Agency)'=>'Alika tovuti kwenye timu (Wakala)','Creates a single-use invite code (role: read or write; label; days valid). The code is shown once.'=>'Hutengeneza msimbo wa mwaliko wa matumizi ya mara moja (jukumu: kusoma au kuandika; lebo; siku za uhalali). Msimbo huonyeshwa mara moja tu.','List team members (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha wanatimu (Pro)','Lists the sites in a team and their access.'=>'Huorodhesha tovuti katika timu na ufikiaji wake.','Remove a team member (Agency)'=>'Ondoa mwanachama wa timu (Wakala)','Removes a site from a team.'=>'Huondoa tovuti kwenye timu.','Add a query loop (Pro)'=>'Ongeza kitanzi cha hoja (Pro)','Adds a query loop with a ready-made card, on a new page (pageTitle, status) or at the end of a post (post): source posts|users|terms|field, postType (product for a shop grid), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, pagination, and live filters [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].'=>'Inaongeza mzunguko wa hoja ulio na kadi iliyotengenezwa tayari, kwenye ukurasa mpya (pageTitle, status) au mwishoni mwa chapisho (post): chanzo posts|users|terms|field, postType (product kwa ajili ya gridi ya duka), perPage, columns, orderBy, order, mpangilio wa kurasa, na vichujio vya moja kwa moja [{type: search|taxonomy|meta|sort|price|onsale|instock, taxonomy, key, label, ui}].','List Lottie animations (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha vibonzo vya Lottie (Pro)','Lists the uploaded Lottie animations.'=>'Huorodhesha michoro ya Lottie iliyopakiwa.','Upload a Lottie animation (Pro)'=>'Pakia uhuishaji wa Lottie (Pro)','Validates a Lottie JSON document (json, name) and publishes it as a static file for the Lottie block.'=>'Huthibitisha hati ya Lottie JSON (json, name) na kuichapisha kama faili tuli kwa ajili ya kizuizi cha Lottie.','List the A/B tests and their results (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha majaribio ya A/B na matokeo yake (Pro)','Lists the A/B tests with each version\'s visitors and conversions, and which one is winning.'=>'Huorodhesha majaribio ya A/B pamoja na wageni na ubadilishaji wa kila toleo, na ni toleo lipi linaloongoza.','Create an A/B test (Pro)'=>'Unda jaribio la A/B (Pro)','Adds a test of two versions of a section to the end of a post (post, name, a, b; split and goal optional).'=>'Inaongeza jaribio la matoleo mawili ya sehemu hadi mwisho wa chapisho (post, name, a, b; split na goal ni hiari).','Reset an A/B test\'s results (Pro)'=>'Weka upya matokeo ya jaribio la A/B (Pro)','Clears a test\'s counts and starts it again (test).'=>'Hufuta hesabu za jaribio na kulianzisha tena (jaribio).','List the mailing-list connections (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha miunganisho ya orodha ya barua pepe (Pro)','Lists the mailing-list services (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) and which are connected. Keys are never returned.'=>'Huorodhesha huduma za orodha ya barua pepe (Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit, ActiveCampaign) na zilizounganishwa. Funguo hazirudishwi kamwe.','Connect a mailing-list service (Pro)'=>'Unganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe (Pro)','Connects a mailing-list service with its API key (service, key; account where the service needs one), or disconnects it with an empty key.'=>'Inaunganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe na ufunguo wake wa API (huduma, ufunguo; akaunti ambapo huduma inaihitaji), au inaikata kwa ufunguo tupu.','List a service\'s mailing lists (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha orodha za barua pepe za huduma (Pro)','Lists the audiences or lists of a connected mailing-list service, for a form\'s subscribe action.'=>'Huorodhesha hadhira au orodha za huduma ya orodha ya barua pepe iliyounganishwa, kwa ajili ya kitendo cha kujisajili cha fomu.','Read the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Soma bango la idhini ya vidakuzi (Pro)','Returns the consent banner: whether it is on, its text and design, the categories, and where it applies.'=>'Hurejesha bango la idhini: iwapo limewashwa, maandishi na muundo wake, kategoria, na pale linapotumika.','Change the cookie consent banner (Pro)'=>'Badilisha bango la idhini ya kuki (Pro)','Changes the consent banner. While it is on, tracking scripts wait for the visitor\'s consent.'=>'Hubadilisha bango la idhini. Wakati imewashwa, hati za ufuatiliaji husubiri idhini ya mgeni.','Create a starter cookie banner (Pro)'=>'Unda bango la kuanzia la kuki (Pro)','Creates a ready-made consent banner design to start from.'=>'Hutengeneza muundo wa bango la idhini uliotengenezwa tayari kuanzia.','List the form-builder forms (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha fomu za mjenzi wa fomu (Pro)','Lists every form made with the form builder: the page it is on, its fields and what happens when it is sent.'=>'Huorodhesha kila fomu iliyoundwa kwa kijenzi cha fomu: ukurasa ilipo, sehemu zake na kile kinachotokea inapotumwa.','Create a form (Pro)'=>'Unda fomu (Pro)','Creates a form (contact, quote, signup or multi-step: fields, steps, settings and actions such as email, save, webhook or a mailing list), on a new page or at the end of an existing post (post).'=>'Hutengeneza fomu (ya mawasiliano, nukuu ya bei, kujisajili au ya hatua nyingi: sehemu, hatua, mipangilio na vitendo kama vile barua pepe, kuhifadhi, webhook au orodha ya wanaotumiwa barua pepe), kwenye ukurasa mpya au mwishoni mwa chapisho lililopo (post).','Change a form (Pro)'=>'Badilisha fomu (Pro)','Changes one form (post, form): settings and actions merge with what is there; fields (and steps) replace the fields.'=>'Hubadilisha fomu moja (post, form): mipangilio na vitendo huunganishwa na kile kilichopo; sehemu (na hatua) huchukua nafasi ya sehemu hizo.','List the animation and interaction settings (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha mipangilio ya uhuishaji na maingiliano (Pro)','Returns every motion setting (entrance animation, its length and delay, scroll effect, hover effect, stay in view, parallax, follow the pointer) with its choices or range, and the site\'s breakpoints.'=>'Hurejesha kila mpangilio wa mwendo (uhuishaji wa kuingia, urefu na ucheleweshaji wake, madoido ya kusogeza, madoido ya kuelekeza kipanya, kubaki kwenye mwonekano, parallax, kufuata kielekezi) pamoja na chaguo au masafa yake, na vizuizi vya tovuti.','Animate a block (Pro)'=>'Huisha kizuizi (Pro)','Sets or removes (null) motion settings on one block of a page, found by its path, at a breakpoint (base by default). Works on any block, including core blocks whose HTML is saved in the page. Visitors who ask for reduced motion never see the movement.'=>'Huweka au huondoa (null) mipangilio ya mwendo kwenye kizuizi kimoja cha ukurasa, kilichopatikana kwa njia yake, katika sehemu ya kukatiza (chaguo-msingi base). Hufanya kazi kwenye kizuizi chochote, ikiwa ni pamoja na vizuizi vya msingi ambavyo HTML yake imehifadhiwa kwenye ukurasa. Wageni wanaoomba mwendo uliopunguzwa kamwe hawaoni msogeo huo.','List the popups (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha madirisha ibukizi (Pro)','Lists the popups, slide-ins and bars with their triggers, frequency rules and where they show.'=>'Huorodhesha madirisha ibukizi, vipengele vinavyoteleza na pau pamoja na vichochezi vyake, sheria za marudio na mahali vinapoonekana.','Create a popup (Pro)'=>'Unda dirisha ibukizi (Pro)','Creates a popup, slide-in or bar: its content, trigger (exit intent, scroll, time, click), frequency and the pages it shows on.'=>'Hutengeneza kidukizo, kidirisha kinachoteleza au upau: maudhui yake, kichochezi (dhamira ya kuondoka, kusogeza, muda, kubofya), marudio na kurasa kinamoonekana.','Change a popup (Pro)'=>'Badilisha kidirisha ibukizi (Pro)','Changes a popup, slide-in or bar (id): content, trigger, frequency or where it shows.'=>'Hubadilisha dirisha ibukizi, slide-in au upau (id): maudhui, kianzishi, marudio au mahali linapoonyeshwa.','Read form submissions (Pro)'=>'Soma mawasilisho ya fomu (Pro)','Lists what visitors sent through the forms that save submissions (form narrows it), a page at a time.'=>'Huorodhesha kile ambacho wageni walituma kupitia fomu zinazohifadhi mawasilisho (fomu huipunguza), ukurasa mmoja kwa wakati mmoja.','Read the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Soma ufuatiliaji wa ubadilishaji (Pro)','Returns the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which clicks and form submissions are sent.'=>'Hurejesha mipangilio ya Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager na Meta Pixel na ni mibofyo na uwasilishaji wa fomu upi unaotumwa.','Change the conversion tracking (Pro)'=>'Badilisha ufuatiliaji wa uongofu (Pro)','Changes the Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager and Meta Pixel settings and which events are sent.'=>'Hubadilisha mipangilio ya Google Analytics 4, Google Tag Manager na Meta Pixel na matukio yanayotumwa.','Read the legacy migration'=>'Soma uhamishaji wa urithi','Returns the 5.x content conversion\'s progress and report.'=>'Hurejesha maendeleo na ripoti ya ubadilishaji maudhui ya 5.x.','Convert legacy content'=>'Badilisha maudhui ya zamani','Starts (or restarts) converting every 5.x page to blocks; each post is backed up first.'=>'Inaanza (au kuanzisha upya) kubadilisha kila ukurasa wa 5.x kuwa vizuizi; kila chapisho huhifadhiwa nakala kwanza.','Undo the legacy migration'=>'Tengua uhamishaji wa awali','Restores every converted post from its backup.'=>'Hurejesha kila chapisho lililobadilishwa kutoka kwenye nakala yake rudufu.','Read the newsletter connection (Pro)'=>'Soma muunganisho wa jarida (Pro)','Says whether a Mailchimp key is saved (the key itself is never returned).'=>'Inasema ikiwa ufunguo wa Mailchimp umehifadhiwa (ufunguo wenyewe haurejeshwi kamwe).','Connect Mailchimp (Pro)'=>'Unganisha Mailchimp (Pro)','Saves (or, with an empty value, removes) the Mailchimp API key the newsletter block uses.'=>'Huhifadhi (au, kukiwa na thamani tupu, huondoa) ufunguo wa Mailchimp API unaotumiwa na kizuizi cha jarida.','Convert one legacy page'=>'Badilisha ukurasa mmoja wa zamani','Converts one 5.x page to blocks (backed up first).'=>'Hubadilisha ukurasa mmoja wa 5.x kuwa vizuizi (huhifadhiwa nakala kwanza).','Undo one conversion'=>'Batilisha ubadilishaji mmoja','Restores one converted page from its backup.'=>'Hurejesha ukurasa mmoja uliobadilishwa kutoka kwa nakala yake rudufu.','Read the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Soma vyanzo vya maoni (Pro)','Returns the Google and Trustpilot sources the Reviews block shows.'=>'Hurejesha vyanzo vya Google na Trustpilot vinavyoonyeshwa na kizuizi cha maoni.','Change the reviews sources (Pro)'=>'Badilisha vyanzo vya maoni (Pro)','Sets the Google place and Trustpilot business the Reviews block reads.'=>'Huweka eneo la Google na biashara ya Trustpilot inayosomeka na kizuizi cha Maoni.','Refresh reviews now (Pro)'=>'Onyesha upya maoni sasa (Pro)','Fetches the latest Trustpilot reviews now instead of waiting for the daily refresh.'=>'Hupata hakiki za hivi karibuni za Trustpilot sasa badala ya kusubiri uboreshaji wa kila siku.','Read the plugin settings'=>'Soma mipangilio ya programu-jalizi','Returns the front-end class prefix, the beta-updates state and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Hurejesha kiambishi awali cha tabaka ya mbele, hali ya masasisho ya beta na kama mawakala wa AI (MCP) wanaruhusiwa.','Change the plugin settings'=>'Badilisha mipangilio ya programu-jalizi','Changes the front-end class prefix (1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter) and/or turns AI agents (MCP) on or off (mcp: false removes every ability and the MCP endpoint).'=>'Hubadilisha kiambishi awali cha tabaka la upande wa mbele (herufi 1 hadi 8 ndogo au tarakimu, kikianzia na herufi) na/au huwasha au huzima mawakala wa AI (MCP) (mcp: false huondoa kila uwezo na kituo cha mwisho cha MCP).','Add a product block or mini cart (Pro)'=>'Ongeza kizuizi cha bidhaa au rukwama ndogo (Pro)','Adds a WooCommerce block at the end of a post: a product element (part: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, or 0 for the product being viewed) or a mini cart (label).'=>'Inaongeza kizuizi cha WooCommerce mwishoni mwa chapisho: kipengele cha bidhaa (sehemu: title, gallery, image, price, rating, excerpt, description, add_to_cart, meta, tabs, related, upsells, sale_badge, stock; productId, au 0 kwa bidhaa inayotazamwa) au mkokoteni mdogo (label).','Read the theme builder\'s choices (Pro)'=>'Soma chaguo za mjenzi wa mandhari (Pro)','Returns the template types, the display-condition kinds (page, post type, term, archive, search, 404, logged in, role, device, date, time, URL parameter, referrer, language, cart) with their choices on this site (roles, languages, post types, taxonomies), and the block attribute (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) that shows or hides any block — set it with pbs/update-block.'=>'Hurejesha aina za violezo, aina za masharti ya kuonyesha (ukurasa, aina ya chapisho, neno, kumbukumbu, utafutaji, 404, umeingia, jukumu, kifaa, tarehe, saa, kigezo cha URL, mwelekezaji, lugha, rukwama) pamoja na chaguo zake kwenye tovuti hii (majukumu, lugha, aina za machapisho, taksonomia), na sifa ya kizuizi (pbswConditions: {match, rules}) inayoonyesha au kuficha kizuizi chochote — iweke kwa pbs/update-block.','List the theme templates (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha violezo vya mandhari (Pro)','Lists the theme builder\'s templates (header, footer, single, archive, search, 404 and, with WooCommerce, product, shop, cart, checkout, thank-you and My Account): each one\'s type, where it shows (include/exclude rules), priority, status and blocks.'=>'Huorodhesha violezo vya kijenzi cha mandhari (kichwa, kijachini, moja, kumbukumbu, utafutaji, 404 na, pamoja na WooCommerce, bidhaa, duka, rukwama, malipo, asante na Akaunti Yangu): aina ya kila kiolezo, mahali kinapoonekana (sheria za kujumuisha/kutojumuisha), kipaumbele, hali na vizuizi.','Create a theme template (Pro)'=>'Unda kiolezo cha mandhari (Pro)','Creates a template (title, type) that replaces that part of every matching page, on classic and block themes. Without content it starts from a ready-made design for its type. include/exclude are display-condition rules ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; see pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority breaks ties; status publish (live) or draft.'=>'Hutengeneza kiolezo (title, type) kinachochukua nafasi ya sehemu hiyo ya kila ukurasa unaolingana, kwenye mandhari za kitamaduni na za vizuizi. Bila maudhui huanzia kwenye muundo uliotengenezwa tayari kwa aina yake. include/exclude ni sheria za hali ya kuonyesha ({kind, values, key, value, from, to, days}; tazama pbs/get-theme-builder-options); priority huvunja mlingano; status publish (moja kwa moja) au draft.','Delete a theme template (Pro)'=>'Futa kiolezo cha mandhari (Pro)','Moves one template (id) to the trash; the theme\'s own design shows again where it applied. Restorable from the trash.'=>'Hupeleka kiolezo kimoja (id) kwenye jalala; muundo wa mandhari yenyewe unaonyeshwa tena mahali palipotumika. Inaweza kurejeshwa kutoka kwenye jalala.','Change a theme template (Pro)'=>'Badilisha kiolezo cha mandhari (Pro)','Changes one template (id): any of title, type, content (block markup), include, exclude, priority, status. Only what you send changes.'=>'Hubadilisha kiolezo kimoja (id): chochote kati ya kichwa, aina, maudhui (alama ya kizuizi), jumuisha, tenga, kipaumbele, hali. Ni kile unachotuma pekee ndicho kinachobadilika.','Export designs and settings'=>'Hamisha miundo na mipangilio','Exports the chosen templates and patterns (ids) and, optionally, settings as one package for another site.'=>'Huuza nje violezo na mitindo iliyochaguliwa (ids) na, kwa hiari, mipangilio kama kifurushi kimoja cha tovuti nyingine.','Import designs and settings'=>'Leta miundo na mipangilio','Imports a package made by pbs/export-designs (dryRun first to see what would change; mode: skip or replace; media; settings).'=>'Huingiza kifurushi kilichotengenezwa na pbs/export-designs (endesha dryRun kwanza ili kuona kile kitakachobadilika; hali: skip au replace; vyombo vya habari; mipangilio).','List what can be exported'=>'Orodhesha kinachoweza kusafirishwa nje','Lists the templates, patterns and settings that can be exported to another site.'=>'Huorodhesha templeti, ruwaza na mipangilio inayoweza kuhamishwa hadi kwenye tovuti nyingine.','Read maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Soma hali ya matengenezo (Pro)','Returns maintenance / coming-soon mode: mode, page, retry-after and which roles still see the site.'=>'Hurejesha hali ya matengenezo / inakuja hivi karibuni: hali, ukurasa, retry-after na ni majukumu gani ambayo bado yanaona tovuti.','Change maintenance mode (Pro)'=>'Badilisha hali ya matengenezo (Pro)','Turns maintenance (503) or coming-soon mode on or off (mode), with the page to show (page_id), retry_after and the roles that bypass it.'=>'Huwasha au kuzima hali ya matengenezo (503) au inayokuja hivi karibuni (mode), ikiwa na ukurasa wa kuonyesha (page_id), retry_after na majukumu yanayoipita.','List find-and-replace jobs (Pro)'=>'Orodhesha kazi za kutafuta na kubadilisha (Pro)','Lists the site-wide find-and-replace jobs and their state.'=>'Huorodhesha kazi za kutafuta-na-kubadilisha kwenye tovuti nzima na hali yake.','Find and replace across the site (Pro)'=>'Tafuta na ubadilishe kwenye tovuti nzima (Pro)','Starts a block-safe find-and-replace (find, replace, kind: text, link or colour; match_case; types). Nothing changes until pbs/apply-replace.'=>'Huanzisha utafutaji na ubadilishaji salama wa vizuizi (find, replace, kind: text, link au colour; match_case; types). Hakuna kinachobadilika hadi pbs/apply-replace.','Preview a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Hakiki tafuta na ubadilishe (Pro)','Returns a job\'s matches, page by page, to review before applying.'=>'Hutoa matokeo yanayolingana na kazi, ukurasa kwa ukurasa, ili yakaguliwe kabla ya kutuma maombi.','Apply a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Tumia tafuta na ubadilishe (Pro)','Applies a previewed job. Every changed post keeps a backup for pbs/undo-replace.'=>'Hutumia kazi iliyokaguliwa. Kila chapisho lililobadilishwa huweka nakala rudufu ya pbs/undo-replace.','Undo a find-and-replace (Pro)'=>'Tengua tafuta na ubadilishe (Pro)','Restores the posts a job changed (a post edited since keeps its edit).'=>'Hurejesha machapisho yaliyobadilishwa na kazi (chapisho lililohaririwa tangu wakati huo huhifadhi uhariri wake).','Read builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Soma vibali vya mjenzi (Pro)','Returns which roles may use the builder, design, code and templates (client mode).'=>'Hurejesha majukumu yanayoweza kutumia kijenzi, usanifu, msimbo na violezo (hali ya mteja).','Change builder permissions (Pro)'=>'Badilisha ruhusa za mjenzi (Pro)','Sets per role what the builder allows (roles), e.g. a content-only 