d library (2 MB at most).'=>'Muundo huu ni mkubwa sana kuweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye maktaba ya wingu (zaidi ya 2 MB).','An image in this design is too large for the cloud library.'=>'Picha katika muundo huu ni kubwa mno kwa maktaba ya wingu.','An image in this design could not be saved. The cloud library keeps WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF and AVIF images.'=>'Picha katika muundo huu haikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Maktaba ya wingu huweka picha za WebP, JPEG, PNG, GIF na AVIF.','Your licence has expired or was cancelled, so nothing new can be saved. Your saved designs are still here; renew to save again.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake au imefutwa, kwa hivyo hakuna kipya kinachoweza kuhifadhiwa. Miundo yako iliyohifadhiwa bado iko hapa; fanya upya ili kuhifadhi tena.','We could not confirm a Page Builder Sandwich Pro licence on this site. Check that the licence is activated here (Account screen).'=>'Hatukuweza kuthibitisha leseni ya Page Builder Sandwich Pro kwenye tovuti hii. Angalia kama leseni imewashwa hapa (skrini ya Akaunti).','This needs Page Builder Sandwich Pro.'=>'Hii inahitaji Page Builder Sandwich Pro.','This site can use the team library but not change it. Ask the team owner for write access.'=>'Tovuti hii inaweza kutumia maktaba ya timu lakini haiwezi kuibadilisha. Mwombe mmiliki wa timu idhini ya kuandika.','Team libraries come with the Agency plan.'=>'Maktaba za timu zinajumuishwa kwenye mpango wa Agency.','Only the licence owner\'s sites can manage teams.'=>'Tovuti za mmiliki wa leseni pekee ndizo zinazoweza kudhibiti timu.','That invite code is not valid or has already been used.'=>'Nambari hiyo ya mwaliko si sahihi au tayari imetumika.','You have reached a team limit of your plan.'=>'Umefikia kikomo cha timu cha mpango wako.','That library item was not found. It may have been deleted on another site.'=>'Kipengee hicho cha maktaba hakikupatikana. Huenda kimefutwa kwenye tovuti nyingine.','This site\'s connection to the cloud library has expired. Try again: it reconnect