ezo vya mandhari','Theme template'=>'Kiolezo cha mandhari','Add template'=>'Ongeza kiolezo','Edit template'=>'Hariri kiolezo','No templates yet.'=>'Bado hakuna violezo.','Theme builder'=>'Kijenzi cha mandhari','Shows on'=>'Inaonekana kwenye','Sale!'=>'Punguzo!','Cart'=>'Kikapu','%s item'=>'Kipengee %s' . "\0" . 'Vipengee %s','Single product'=>'Bidhaa moja','Shop and product categories'=>'Vitengo vya duka na bidhaa','Order received (thank you)'=>'Agizo limepokelewa (asante)','My Account'=>'Akaunti Yangu','Product'=>'Bidhaa','Regular price'=>'Bei ya kawaida','Sale price'=>'Bei ya mauzo','SKU'=>'SKU','Stock status'=>'Hali ya hisa','Average rating'=>'Wastani wa ukadiriaji','Number of reviews'=>'Idadi ya maoni','Short description'=>'Maelezo mafupi','Categories'=>'Kategoria','Product image'=>'Picha ya bidhaa','Add to cart link'=>'Kiungo cha kuongeza kwenye rukwama','Add to cart label'=>'Lebo ya "Ongeza kwenye rukwama"','Price: low to high'=>'Bei: kuanzia chini hadi juu','Price: high to low'=>'Bei: ya juu hadi ya chini','Highest rated'=>'Iliyokadiriwa juu zaidi','We are doing some maintenance on this site. Please check back soon.'=>'Tunafanya matengenezo kwenye tovuti hii. Tafadhali angalia tena hivi karibuni.','This site is launching soon.'=>'Tovuti hii itazinduliwa hivi karibuni.','Maintenance mode is on'=>'Hali ya matengenezo imewashwa','Pre-launch mode is on'=>'Hali ya kabla ya uzinduzi imewashwa','Network templates'=>'Violezo vya mtandao','That find-and-replace job no longer exists.'=>'Kazi hiyo ya kutafuta na kubadilisha haipo tena.','That step is not available for this job right now.'=>'Hatua hiyo haipatikani kwa kazi hii kwa sasa.','Enter what to find.'=>'Weka unachotaka kutafuta.','Colours must be hex codes such as #1a73e8 or #fff.'=>'Rangi lazima ziwe misimbo ya hex kama vile #1a73e8 au #fff.','The new link must be a full web address (https://…), a path starting with /, or an anchor starting with #.'=>'Kiungo kipya lazima kiwe anwani kamili ya wavuti (https://…), njia inayoanza na /, au nanga inayoanza na #.','Client review comments'=>'Maoni ya ukaguzi wa mteja','Write a comment first.'=>'Andika maoni kwanza.','Client'=>'Mteja','That comment no longer exists.'=>'Maoni hayo hayapo tena.','New review comment on “%s”'=>'Maoni mapya ya ukaguzi kwenye "%s"','%1$s wrote:

%2$s

Open the page in the editor to answer or resolve it:
%3$s'=>'%1$s aliandika:

%2$s

Fungua ukurasa kwenye kihariri ili kujibu au kusuluhisha:
%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Kiungo hiki cha maoni si halali tena. Omba kipya.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Maoni mengi mno kutoka kwa kiungo hiki katika saa iliyopita. Jaribu tena baadaye.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Wajibu wako hauwezi kuunda violezo au ruwaza.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Unaweza kubadilisha maandishi na picha kwenye ukurasa huu, lakini si mpangilio au muundo wake. Mabadiliko yako hayajahifadhiwa.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Jukumu lako haliwezi kubadilisha mitindo. Tendua mabadiliko ya mtindo na uhifadhi tena.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Jukumu lako haliwezi kuongeza au kubadilisha msimbo maalum (CSS maalum au vizuizi vya HTML). Tendua mabadiliko hayo na uhifadhi tena.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Hili si faili la uhamishaji kutoka kwa programu-jalizi hii.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Faili hili la kuhamisha lilitengenezwa na toleo jipya zaidi la jalajala. Sasisha jalajala kwenye tovuti hii, kisha uliingize tena.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Faili la kuhamisha limeharibika: orodha yake ya vipengee haipo.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Faili la kuhamisha limeharibika au lilihaririwa baada ya kutengenezwa (hundi ya hundi hailingani). Lihamishe tena kutoka kwenye tovuti nyingine.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'“%s” haikuingizwa: tovuti hii haina aina hiyo ya kipengee.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'“%s” haikuagizwa: hauruhusiwi kuunda aina hiyo ya kipengee.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'“%s” haikubadilishwa: hauruhusiwi kuhariri iliyo kwenye tovuti hii.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” haikuletwa: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'Mipangilio haikuagizwa: msimamizi pekee ndiye anayeweza kuibadilisha.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'Picha %1$s haikunakiliwa: %2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Onyesha tena mapendekezo yaliyofichwa kwenye Muhtasari','%d selected'=>'%d zimechaguliwa' . "\0" . '%d zimechaguliwa','Nothing matches.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana.','Select all on this page'=>'Chagua zote kwenye ukurasa huu','Select'=>'Chagua','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Ukurasa %1$d kati ya %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Sanidi %s kwa dakika chache','Start setup'=>'Anza usanidi','This site'=>'Tovuti hii','Edition'=>'Toleo','Sites on this licence'=>'Tovuti zilizo kwenye leseni hii','Version'=>'Toleo','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Hii inaonekana kama nakala ya majaribio au ya ndani, kwa hivyo haitumii tovuti kwenye leseni yako.','See what Pro adds'=>'Tazama kile ambacho Pro huongeza','Go to'=>'Nenda kwenye','Personal'=>'Binafsi','Business'=>'Biashara','Agency'=>'Wakala','Any number of sites'=>'Idadi yoyote ya tovuti','Unlimited sites'=>'Tovuti zisizo na kikomo','%d site'=>'tovuti %d' . "\0" . 'tovuti %d','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'Majaribio ya %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Jaribio lako limeanza. Pakia upya ukurasa ili uone kila kipengele cha Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Majaribio hayangeweza kuanza.','Feature'=>'Kipengele','Your licence'=>'Leseni yako','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d kati ya %2$d inatumika','Renews'=>'Inajisasisha','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Nakala za jukwaa la majaribio (staging), majaribio na mwenyeji wa ndani (localhost) za tovuti ni za bure na hazihesabiwi kamwe kwenye kikomo cha tovuti yako.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Kifurushi chako kinajumuisha usaidizi wa kipaumbele.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Dhibiti leseni yako na malipo','Get more with Pro'=>'Pata zaidi ukitumia Pro','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Anza jaribio la bure la siku %d, hakuna kadi inayohitajika' . "\0" . 'Anza jaribio la bure la siku %d, hakuna kadi inayohitajika','See plans and prices'=>'Tazama mipango na bei','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Unatumia Tranzly na Page Builder Sandwich pamoja? Kifurushi hiki kinajumuisha programu-jalizi zote mbili za Pro kwa gharama nafuu.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Leseni yako imeisha muda wake. Ihuyshe ili uendelee kupata sasisho na vipengele vya Pro.','Renew now'=>'Hifadhi upya sasa','Compare the plans'=>'Linganisha mipango','Search features'=>'Tafuta vipengele','Area'=>'Eneo','Included in'=>'Imejumuishwa katika','No feature matches.'=>'Hakuna kipengele kinacholingana.','Features by plan'=>'Vipengele kulingana na kifurushi','Hide'=>'Ficha','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Iwashe kwenye skrini ya programu-jalizi','Install it'=>'Isakinishe','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Setup'=>'Usanidi','Plans and licence'=>'Vifurushi na leseni','Add-ons'=>'Viongezi','Feedback'=>'Maoni','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Chaguo lako halikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Hali ya kusanidi haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Match my computer'=>'Linganisha na kompyuta yangu','Light'=>'Nyeupe','Dark'=>'Giza','Colour scheme'=>'Mpangilio wa rangi','Help'=>'Usaidizi','Guide to this screen'=>'Mwongozo wa skrini hii','Take the tour'=>'Anza ziara','Get help or report a bug'=>'Pata usaidizi au ripoti hitilafu','Plugin screens'=>'Skrini za programu-jalizi','That could not be saved.'=>'Hiyo haikuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Before you contact support'=>'Kabla ya kuwasiliana na dawati la usaidizi','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Ombi lako linatumwa kutoka kwa tovuti hii hadi kwa %s, wanaotengeneza programu-jalizi hii. Tunatuma:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'anwani yako ya barua pepe na jina, ili tuweze kujibu;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mada na ujumbe unaoandika;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'kitambulisho chako cha leseni, ili wateja wanaolipa wapate kipaumbele;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'ikiwa tu utaiweka alama: maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo ya WordPress na PHP, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo ya kumbukumbu ya hitilafu huku manenosiri na anwani za barua pepe zikiwa zimeondolewa), ambayo unaweza kuyasoma kabla ya kutuma;','I agree, continue'=>'Ninakubali, endelea','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Muunganisho haukuweza kuangaliwa.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Hiyo haikufanya kazi. Jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® umetenganisha tovuti hii.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® hautambui tena tovuti hii.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Ulikata muunganisho wa tovuti hii.','Connect this site to support'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii kwenye usaidizi','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Majibu yanaenda kwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Haijaunganishwa. Bado unaweza kutuma ombi ukitumia anwani yako ya barua pepe hapa chini; kuunganisha kunaepusha kuiandika kila mara.','E-mail address'=>'Barua pepe','Your name (optional)'=>'Jina lako (hiari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ninakubali kuunganisha tovuti hii na usaidizi wa Zinn Digital®. Inatuma anwani ya tovuti hii, matoleo ya WordPress na PHP na toleo la programu-jalizi, na inaweza kukatwa wakati wowote kutoka hapa au na Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Unganisha','I need help'=>'Nahitaji usaidizi','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti hitilafu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','The site details could not be read.'=>'Maelezo ya tovuti hayakuweza kusomwa.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ombi lako halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Maoni na maombi ya vipengele','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Nambari yako ya kumbukumbu ni %s, na jibu letu litatumwa kwa barua pepe.','What is it about?'=>'Inahusu nini?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Jibu kwa (barua pepe)','Subject'=>'Mada','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Ulifanya nini, ulitarajia nini, na nini kilitokea badala yake?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Jumuisha maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo ya kumbukumbu ya hitilafu)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Tazama hasa kile kinachotumwa','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Funga ziara','Everything in one place'=>'Kila kitu mahali pamoja','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Vichupo hivi vinaelekeza kwenye kila skrini ya programu-jalizi: usanidi, mipangilio, leseni yako, usaidizi na zaidi.','Help on every screen'=>'Usaidizi kwenye kila skrini','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fungua menyu hii ili kupata mwongozo wa skrini uliyopo, ziara hii, au kutuomba msaada.','Light or dark'=>'Nyeupe au nyeusi','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Chagua mwangaza, giza, au sawa na kompyuta yako. Chaguo lako linakumbukwa kwa ajili yako tu.','Welcome'=>'Karibu','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ziara hii fupi inaonyesha mahali vitu vilipo. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote kwa Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Tovuti yako kwa muhtasari','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Maendeleo ya usanidi na mpango wako yanaonyeshwa hapa, pamoja na hatua inayofuata inayofaa kufanywa.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Mpango wako, idadi ya tovuti unazoshughulikia, na iwapo nakala hii ya tovuti inahesabiwa katika kikomo hicho.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Jaribu Pro au pata toleo jipya','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Anza jaribio la bila malipo bila kadi, pata toleo jipya, au fanya upya, yote kutoka hapa.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kila kipengele na kifurushi kinachokijumuisha. Tafuta kipengele au onyesha eneo moja kwa wakati mmoja.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zaidi kutoka Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Programu-jalizi zinazofanya kazi na hii, na huduma kutoka kwa timu hiyo hiyo. Kadi ulizoficha kwenye skrini zingine zinaweza kuonyeshwa tena hapa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Unganisha ili upate usaidizi wa haraka zaidi','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Kuunganisha ni hiari. Inakuruhusu kutuma maombi bila kuandika barua pepe yako kila wakati, na unaweza kukata muunganisho wakati wowote upendao.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Omba usaidizi au ripoti hitilafu','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Eleza kilichotokea. Unachagua ikiwa utaambatisha maelezo ya tovuti, na unaweza kuona kwanza kile hasa kilichomo.','Tell us what to build'=>'Tuambie nini cha kujenga','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Tuma wazo, ombi la kipengele au maoni yoyote. Yanaenda moja kwa moja kwa timu.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Hii inachukua dakika chache na kusanidi %s ili ifanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii mara moja. Unaweza kubadilisha kila kitu baadaye.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Uko tayari. Ikiwa chochote hakitafanya kazi inavyotarajiwa, tuko umbali wa mbofyo mmoja tu.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Maliza','Skip setup'=>'Ruka usanidi','Import “%s”'=>'Ingiza "%s"','%d page imported.'=>'Ukurasa %d umeingizwa.' . "\0" . 'Kurasa %d zimeingizwa.','edit'=>'Hariri','Pages to import'=>'Kurasa za kuingiza','Publish the pages now (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Chapisha kurasa sasa (vinginevyo zitahifadhiwa kama rasimu)','Use the kit’s home page as the site’s front page'=>'Tumia ukurasa wa nyumbani wa seti kama ukurasa wa mbele wa tovuti','Create a menu with the imported pages'=>'Unda menyu ukitumia kurasa zilizoingizwa','Importing never changes your existing pages. Importing the same kit again updates the pages it created before.'=>'Kuagiza hakubadilishi kamwe kurasa zako zilizopo. Kuagiza tena kifurushi kile kile husasisha kurasa zilizoundwa hapo awali.','Import'=>'Leta','Complete websites you can import in one click: pages, sections and a menu, ready for your own words and pictures. Kits come from Zinn Digital® and new ones are added every month.'=>'Tovuti kamili unazoweza kuingiza kwa mbofyo mmoja: kurasa, sehemu na menyu, tayari kwa maneno na picha zako mwenyewe. Vifurushi vinatoka Zinn Digital® na vipya huongezwa kila mwezi.','Search kits'=>'Tafuta vifaa','Category'=>'Kipengele','All categories'=>'Vitengo vyote','Free and Pro'=>'Bure na Pro','Go Pro to import'=>'Pata toleo la Pro ili kuingiza','No kit matches these filters.'=>'Hakuna seti inayolingana na vichujio hivi.','My library'=>'Maktaba yangu','Team'=>'Timu','Storage'=>'Hifadhi','Your library is kept in your own storage bucket, so no Zinn Digital® quota applies.'=>'Maktaba yako huwekwa kwenye ndoo yako binafsi ya hifadhi, kwa hivyo hakuna kiwango cha Zinn Digital® kinachotumika.','%1$s of %2$s used (%3$d%%)'=>'%1$s kati ya %2$s imetumika (%3$d%%)','%1$d of %2$d designs · up to %3$s per design · images are resized to 2560 px and stored once'=>'%1$d kati ya miundo %2$d · hadi %3$s kwa kila muundo · picha hubadilishwa ukubwa kuwa px 2560 na kuhifadhiwa mara moja','Deleted from your library.'=>'Imefutwa kutoka kwa maktaba yako.','Save any section or page from the editor: open the block’s ⋮ menu and choose “Save to cloud library”. Insert saved designs from the Cloud library panel in the editor, on any of your sites.'=>'Hifadhi sehemu au ukurasa wowote kutoka kwa kihariri: fungua menyu ya bloku ya ⋮ na uchague "Hifadhi kwenye maktaba ya wingu". Chomeka miundo iliyohifadhiwa kutoka kwa paneli ya maktaba ya Wingu kwenye kihariri, kwenye tovuti yako yoyote.','Show'=>'Onyesha','Everything'=>'Kila kitu','Sections'=>'Sehemu','Styles'=>'Mitindo','Size'=>'Ukubwa','Nothing saved yet.'=>'Bado hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','Delete'=>'Futa','Write a test file'=>'Andika faili la jaribio','Read it back'=>'Soma tena','Delete it'=>'Ifute','In your Cloudflare dashboard, open R2 Object Storage and create a bucket (for example “my-pbs-library”). Keep it private: do not connect a public domain.'=>'Kwenye dashibodi yako ya Cloudflare, fungua R2 Object Storage na uunde bucket (kwa mfano “my-pbs-library”). Iweke iwe ya faragha: usiunganishe kikoa cha umma.','Open “Manage API tokens” in R2 and create an API token with “Object Read & Write” permission, limited to that one bucket.'=>'Fungua “Dhibiti tokeni za API” katika R2 na uunde tokeni ya API yenye ruhusa ya “Kusoma na Kuandika Vipengee”, ikiwa imezuiwa kwa ndoo hiyo moja tu.','Copy the Access Key ID and the Secret Access Key it shows (the secret is shown only once).'=>'Nakili Kitambulisho cha Ufunguo wa Kufikia na Ufunguo wa Siri wa Kufikia unaoonyeshwa (ufunguo wa siri unaonyeshwa mara moja tu).','Copy the S3 endpoint for your account. It looks like https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Region is “auto”.'=>'Nakili kituo cha mwisho cha S3 cha akaunti yako. Inaonekana kama https://<account-id>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com. Eneo ni “auto”.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”. Switch the library to your storage only when the test passes.'=>'Bandika thamani zilizo hapa chini, hifadhi, kisha ubonyeze "Jaribu muunganisho". Badilisha maktaba iwe kwenye hifadhi yako pale tu jaribio litakapofaulu.','Create a private bucket with your provider (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO or any S3-compatible service).'=>'Unda bucket ya faragha na mtoa huduma wako (Amazon S3, Backblaze B2, Wasabi, MinIO au huduma yoyote inayooana na S3).','Create an access key that can read, write and delete objects in that bucket only.'=>'Unda ufunguo wa ufikiaji unaoweza kusoma, kuandika na kufuta vipengee kwenye ndoo hiyo pekee.','Find the S3 endpoint (for Amazon S3: %s) and the bucket’s region.'=>'Pata kituo cha mwisho cha S3 (kwa ajili ya Amazon S3: %s) na eneo la ndoo.','Amazon S3 uses virtual-hosted addresses: switch off “Path-style addresses”. Most other services use path-style.'=>'Amazon S3 hutumia anwani zilizopangishwa kwa njia pepe: zima “Path-style addresses”. Huduma zingine nyingi hutumia mtindo wa njia.','Paste the values below, save, then press “Test connection”.'=>'Bandika thamani hapa chini, hifadhi, kisha ubonyeze “Jaribu muunganisho”.','Storage settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio ya hifadhi imehifadhiwa.','Your cloud library is kept in Zinn Digital® storage with the space your plan includes. You can keep it in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket instead: then no Zinn Digital® quota applies, and every site you connect to the same bucket shares the library. Team libraries always use Zinn Digital® storage.'=>'Maktaba yako ya wingu huwekwa kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn Digital® ikiwa na nafasi ambayo mpango wako unajumuisha. Unaweza kuiweka kwenye ndoo yako binafsi ya Cloudflare R2 au inayotangamana na S3 badala yake: kisha hakuna mgawo wa Zinn Digital® unaotumika, na kila tovuti unayounganisha kwenye ndoo hiyo hiyo hushiriki maktaba hiyo. Maktaba za timu hutumia hifadhi ya Zinn Digital® kila wakati.','Connect your own storage: step by step'=>'Unganisha hifadhi yako mwenyewe: hatua kwa hatua','Another S3-compatible service'=>'Huduma nyingine inayooana na S3','Read the full guide'=>'Soma mwongozo kamili','S3 endpoint'=>'Kituo cha mwisho cha S3','Bucket'=>'Pakiti','Region'=>'Eneo','Cloudflare R2: auto.'=>'Cloudflare R2: otomatiki.','Access key ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha ufunguo wa kufikia','Stored. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Acha wazi ili kuiweka.','Secret access key'=>'Ufunguo wa siri wa ufikiaji','Stored encrypted on this site and never shown again. Leave empty to keep it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa ikiwa imesimbwa kwenye tovuti hii na haitaonyeshwa tena. Acha wazi ili kuiweka.','Stored encrypted on this site. It is never sent to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imehifadhiwa ikiwa imesimbwa kwenye tovuti hii. Haitumwi kamwe kwa Zinn Digital®.','Path-style addresses'=>'Anwani za mtindo wa njia','Folder in the bucket'=>'Folda kwenye ndoo','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Test connection'=>'Jaribu muunganisho','Remove these settings'=>'Ondoa mipangilio hii','Keep my library in this storage'=>'Weka maktaba yangu katika hifadhi hii','The connection test passed.'=>'Jaribio la muunganisho limefaulu.','Run “Test connection” first.'=>'Endesha “Jaribu muunganisho” kwanza.','Invite a site'=>'Alika tovuti','Who is it for? (optional)'=>'Ni kwa ajili ya nani? (si lazima)','Access'=>'Ufikiaji','Use designs (read only)'=>'Tumia miundo (kusoma tu)','Use and save designs'=>'Tumia na uhifadhi miundo','Create invite code'=>'Unda msimbo wa mwaliko','Give this code to the site owner. It works once, for 7 days, and is shown only now:'=>'Mpe msimamizi wa tovuti nambari hii ya kuthibitisha. Inafanya kazi mara moja tu kwa muda wa siku 7, na inaonyeshwa sasa hivi pekee:','Copy'=>'Nakili','Members'=>'Wanachama','No site has joined yet.'=>'Bado hakuna tovuti iliyojiunga.','use and save'=>'Tumia na uhifadhi','read only'=>'Kusoma tu','Delete team'=>'Futa timu','Delete this team and every design in its library?'=>'Futa timu hii na kila usanifu katika maktaba yake?','This site joined the team library.'=>'Tovuti hii imejiunga na maktaba ya timu.','This site uses the team library:'=>'Tovuti hii inatumia maktaba ya timu:','Leave'=>'Ondoka','Join a team with an invite code'=>'Jiunge na timu kwa msimbo wa mwaliko','Join'=>'Jiunge','Your teams'=>'Timu zako','New team name'=>'Jina jipya la timu','Create team'=>'Unda timu','Creating team libraries comes with the Agency plan.'=>'Kuunda maktaba za timu kunajumuishwa kwenye mpango wa Agency.','Save sections, pages and styles to your cloud library and reuse them on all your sites. Agencies can share a library with their team and clients. You can keep the library in Zinn Digital® storage or in your own Cloudflare R2 or S3-compatible bucket.'=>'Hifadhi sehemu, kurasa na mitindo kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu na uzitumie tena kwenye tovuti zako zote. Mashirika yanaweza kushiriki maktaba na timu yao na wateja. Unaweza kuweka maktaba katika hifadhi ya Zinn Digital® au kwenye ndoo yako mwenyewe ya Cloudflare R2 au inayotangamana na S3.','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro'=>'Pata Page Builder Sandwich Pro','Website kits'=>'Vifaa vya tovuti','Cloud library'=>'Maktaba ya wingu','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imejengwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Tovuti ya Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei','Front-end output'=>'Toleo la ukurasa wa mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la tabaka ambalo programu-jalizi inachapisha kwenye kurasa zako huanza na kiambishi awali hiki, ili kurasa zisifichue ni programu-jalizi gani iliyozijenga. Herufi 1 hadi 8 ndogo au tarakimu, kuanzia na herufi.','Beta updates'=>'Masasisho ya beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo ya beta kama masasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Toleo za beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa kwenye akaunti zao. Mara baada ya kuunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kutoka ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Vituo vya kusimama vimehifadhiwa. Kurasa zitachukua upana mpya katika mwonekano wao unaofuata.','Breakpoints'=>'Vituo vya kusimama','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Mitindo iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Kompyuta Kibao inatumika hadi upana wa kompyuta kibao, na mitindo iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Simu inatumika hadi upana wa simu. Mitindo ya Kompyuta ya mezani inatumika kwingineko kote.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kompyuta kibao: hadi (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Simu ya mkononi: hadi (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Hifadhi vidokezo vya kusitisha','Use the default widths'=>'Tumia upana chaguomsingi','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','Templates & kits'=>'Violezo na vifaa','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ombi la kubadilisha chapisho hili lilikoma kabla halijakamilika, kwa hivyo chapisho hilo lilirukwa. Lifungue ili kulibadilisha, au ulibadilishe tena kuanzia hapa.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Hakuna nakala rudufu ya chapisho hili ya kurejesha.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Maudhui yaliyobadilishwa hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Unknown error.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Bado hakuna maudhui ya awali yaliyokaguliwa.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inarejesha maudhui ya awali: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inabadilisha maudhui ya awali: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Utendua umekamilika: %1$d zimerejeshwa, %2$d zimeshindwa.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ugeuzaji umekamilika: %1$d zimegeuzwa, %2$d hazijabadilika, %3$d zimeshindikana.','Legacy content'=>'Maudhui ya zamani','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Kurasa zilizoundwa kwa matoleo ya awali ya Page Builder Sandwich zinabadilishwa kuwa vizuizi chinichini. Kila chapisho huhifadhiwa nakala kwanza, ili kila ubadilishaji uweze kutenduliwa.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Chapisho %d bado lina maudhui ya zamani.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d bado yana maudhui ya zamani.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Chapisho %d lina nakala rudufu.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Chapisho %d halikuweza kushughulikiwa' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d hayakuweza kushughulikiwa','Post %d'=>'Chapisho %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ubadilishaji umeanza. Unaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuondoka kwenye ukurasa huu.','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Rejesha kila chapisho lililobadilishwa kuwa maudhui yake ya awali? Mabadiliko yaliyofanywa kwenye machapisho hayo tangu yalipobadilishwa yatapotea.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Urejesho umeanza. Unaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuondoka kwenye ukurasa huu.','Undo all conversions'=>'Tengua mabadilisho yote','Item'=>'Kipengee','Open when the page loads'=>'Fungua ukurasa unapopakia','Title is a heading'=>'Kichwa ni kichwa cha habari','Make the title a heading when the items are sections of the page, so visitors can jump between them.'=>'Fanya kichwa kiwe kichwa cha habari wakati vipengee ni sehemu za ukurasa, ili wageni waweze kuruka kati yao.','Heading %d'=>'Kichwa cha habari %d','Question or section title'=>'Swali au kichwa cha sehemu','Accordion'=>'Akordioni','Only one item open at a time'=>'Kipengee kimoja tu wazi kwa wakati mmoja','Mark up as FAQ for search engines'=>'Weka alama kama FAQ kwa injini tafuti','Adds FAQ structured data built from the titles (questions) and their text (answers).'=>'Huongeza data iliyoundwa ya FAQ iliyojengwa kutoka kwa vichwa vya habari (maswali) na maandishi yake (majibu).','Alert'=>'Tahadhari','Information'=>'Taarifa','Success'=>'Imefaulu','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Maonyo na makosa hutangazwa kwa watumiaji wa visoma skrini mara moja; taarifa na arifa za mafanikio husomwa wanapomaliza kile wanachofanya.','Show icon'=>'Onyesha aikoni','Visitors can close it'=>'Wageni wanaweza kuifunga','Title (optional)'=>'Kichwa (si lazima)','Write the message…'=>'Andika ujumbe…','Centre'=>'Katikati','Badge'=>'Beji','Colour'=>'Rangi','Theme accent'=>'Rangi ya msisitizo ya mandhari','Neutral'=>'Haupendelei','Position'=>'Nafasi','Label'=>'Lebo','Booking calendar'=>'Kalenda ya kuweka nafasi','Service'=>'Huduma','Booking page address'=>'Anwani ya ukurasa wa kuweka nafasi','For example %s'=>'Kwa mfano %s','What the calendar is for, read out by screen readers and shown under it.'=>'Madhumuni ya kalenda, inasomwa na visoma skrini na kuonyeshwa chini yake.','This is not a %s booking page address, so nothing will show on the page.'=>'Hii si anwani ya ukurasa wa kuhifadhi wa %s, kwa hivyo hakuna kitakachoonekana kwenye ukurasa.','Preview the calendar'=>'Kagua kalenda','Link address'=>'Anwani ya kiungo','The button shows when it has both a label and an address.'=>'Kitufe huonyeshwa kikiwa na lebo na anwani zote mbili.','Open in a new tab'=>'Fungua kwenye kichupo kipya','Layout'=>'Mpangilio','Buttons below'=>'Vitufe vya chini','Buttons beside the text'=>'Vitufe kando ya maandishi','Alignment'=>'Mpangilio','Main button'=>'Kitufe kikuu','Second button'=>'Kitufe cha pili','Heading…'=>'Kichwa…','One sentence on why…'=>'Sentensi moja kuhusu sababu…','Second button (optional)'=>'Kitufe cha pili (si lazima)','Checklist'=>'Orodha ya ukaguzi','Tick colour'=>'Rangi ya tiki','Lines'=>'Mistari','Line %d'=>'Mstari %d','Task…'=>'Jukumu…','Add line'=>'Ongeza mstari','Detect automatically'=>'Gundua kiotomatiki','No highlighting'=>'Hakuna kuangazia','File name'=>'Jina la faili','Shown above the code, for example functions.php.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya msimbo, kwa mfano functions.php.','Line numbers'=>'Nambari za mistari','Copy button'=>'Kitufe cha kunakili','Wrap long lines'=>'Kunja mistari mirefu','Write or paste code…'=>'Andika au bandika msimbo…','Text'=>'Maandishi','Columns'=>'Safu wima','Highlight %s'=>'Angazia %s','Add column'=>'Ongeza safu wima','Rows'=>'Safu','Row %d'=>'Safu mlalo %d','Add row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Caption (what is being compared)'=>'Maelezo mafupi (kinacholinganishwa)','Cell type: %s. Change'=>'Aina ya seli: %s. Badilisha','Phone call'=>'Simu','Text message'=>'Ujumbe wa maandishi','WhatsApp'=>'WhatsApp','Buttons'=>'Vitufe','Phone number, with country code'=>'Nambari ya simu, pamoja na msimbo wa nchi','Button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe','Remove this button'=>'Ondoa kitufe hiki','Add a button'=>'Ongeza kitufe','WhatsApp message to start with (optional)'=>'Ujumbe wa WhatsApp wa kuanzia (si lazima)','Contact buttons'=>'Vitufe vya mawasiliano','Add a phone number, an email address or a WhatsApp number in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza nambari ya simu, anwani ya barua pepe au nambari ya WhatsApp kwenye upau wa kando.','Dual heading'=>'Kichwa habari maradufu','Heading level'=>'Kiwango cha kichwa cha habari','Use H1 once per page, for its main title.'=>'Tumia H1 mara moja kwa kila ukurasa, kwa kichwa kikuu.','Second part look'=>'Muonekano wa sehemu ya pili','Accent colour'=>'Rangi ya msisitizo','Gradient'=>'Rangi mseto','Outline'=>'Muhtasari','Underline'=>'Pigia mstari','Second part on its own line'=>'Sehemu ya pili kwenye mstari wake yenyewe','First part'=>'Sehemu ya kwanza','second part'=>'Sehemu ya pili','Marker pen'=>'Kalamu ya makala','Thick underline'=>'Mstari wa chini mzito','Background'=>'Mandhari nyuma','Highlight'=>'Angazia','Remove highlight'=>'Ondoa mwangaza','Drop cap'=>'Herufi kubwa ya mwanzo','Large first letter'=>'Herufi kubwa ya kwanza','For the first letter in a box, choose the "Drop cap in a box" style.'=>'Kwa herufi ya kwanza kwenye kisanduku, chagua mtindo wa "Drop cap in a box".','Drop cap in a box'=>'Herufi kubwa ya kwanza katika kisanduku','Accent bar'=>'Mwambaa wa msisitizo','Pull quote (accent bar)'=>'Nukuu iliyokolezwa (mwambaa wa mkazo)','A quote from the text, set large beside a coloured bar to draw the eye.'=>'Nukuu kutoka kwenye maandishi, iliyowekwa kubwa kando ya upau wa rangi ili kuvutia macho.','quote'=>'Nukuu','Feature list'=>'Orodha ya vipengele','On phones the features always stack.'=>'Kwenye simu vipengele hupangwa wima kila wakati.','Feature %d'=>'Kipengele %d','Own icon'=>'Aikoni yako','Feature…'=>'Angazia…','Describe it…'=>'Ieleze…','Add feature'=>'Ongeza kipengele','Install and activate Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms or Fluent Forms, then choose one of its forms here.'=>'Sakinisha na uwashe Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms au Fluent Forms, kisha chagua mojawapo ya fomu zake hapa.','Form plugin'=>'Programu-jalizi ya fomu','Choose a form…'=>'Chagua fomu…','%s has no forms yet'=>'%s bado haina fomu zozote','%s is not active on this site, so this form cannot be shown.'=>'%s haijawashwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo fomu hii haiwezi kuonyeshwa.','The form list could not be loaded.'=>'Orodha ya fomu haikuweza kupakiwa.','Form style'=>'Mtindo wa fomu','Fields'=>'Sehemu','Outlined'=>'Yenye mstari wa nje','Filled'=>'Imejazwa','Underlined'=>'Iliyopigiwa mstari','Button width'=>'Upana wa kitufe','Fit the text'=>'Linganisha maandishi','Full width'=>'Upana kamili','Colours, fonts, spacing and corners come from your site design and this block’s design settings.'=>'Rangi, fonti, nafasi na pembe hutoka kwenye muundo wa tovuti yako na mipangilio ya muundo wa kizuizi hiki.','Show a form from your form plugin, styled to match your site.'=>'Onyesha fomu kutoka kwa programu-jalizi yako ya fomu, ikiwa imesanifiwa kulingana na tovuti yako.','Need a form plugin? Contact Form 7 is free.'=>'Unahitaji programu-jalizi ya fomu? Contact Form 7 ni bure.','Glossary'=>'Faharasa','Sort A to Z'=>'Panga kuanzia A hadi Z','The page shows the terms in alphabetical order; here they stay in the order you wrote them.'=>'Ukurasa unaonyesha masharti kwa mpangilio wa alfabeti; hapa yanabaki katika mpangilio uliyoandika.','Show an A–Z index'=>'Onyesha faharasa ya A–Z','Link terms used elsewhere on this page'=>'Unganisha maneno yaliyotumiwa kwingineko kwenye ukurasa huu','The first time each term appears in the page text it links to its definition. Headings, buttons, code and existing links are left alone.'=>'Mara ya kwanza kila neno linapotokea kwenye maandishi ya ukurasa, huunganishwa na maelezo yake. Vichwa vya habari, vitufe, msimbo na viungo vilivyopo huachwa bila kuguswa.','Terms'=>'Masharti','Term %d'=>'Istilahi %d','Term'=>'Neno','What it means…'=>'Inachomaanisha…','Add term'=>'Ongeza neno','Icon list'=>'Orodha ya aikoni','One below the other'=>'Moja chini ya nyingine','Side by side'=>'Bega kwa bega','List item…'=>'Kipengee cha orodha…','Info box'=>'Kisanduku cha maelezo','Or choose any icon from the library:'=>'Au chagua aikoni yoyote kutoka kwenye maktaba:','Link text'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo','Say where the link goes ("See our prices"), not "Read more".'=>'Sema kiungo kinapoelekeza ("Tazama bei zetu"), si "Soma zaidi".','A sentence or two…'=>'Sentensi moja au mbili…','section — a thematic section'=>'sehemu — sehemu ya mada','div — no meaning'=>'div — haina maana','header — introductory content'=>'kichwa — maudhui ya utangulizi','footer — closing content'=>'kijachini — maudhui ya kufunga','article — self-contained content'=>'makala — maudhui yanayojitegemea','aside — related content'=>'pembeni — maudhui yanayohusiana','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'kuu — maudhui makuu (mara moja kwa kila ukurasa)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — viungo vya urambazaji','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Rafu (flexbox, safu wima)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safu mlalo (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Gridi','Editing: %s'=>'Inahariri: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Panga vijenzi tanzu kama','Inherited (%s)'=>'Iliyorithiwa (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Vitalu vilivyowekwa juu','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Buruta kwenye turubai, au chapa','Content width'=>'Upana wa maudhui','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Iliyo ndani ya kisanduku (upana wa maudhui ya mandhari)','Minimum height'=>'Kimo cha chini','HTML tag'=>'Lebo ya HTML','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Fanya kizuizi kizima kiwe kiungo cha','Link text for screen readers'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo kwa ajili ya visoma skrini','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Kile kiungo hufanya, kwa wageni ambao hawawezi kuona kitalu.','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Usiweke viungo au vitufe ndani ya kitalu chenye kiungo: kiungo ndani ya kiungo hakifanyi kazi kwenye vivinjari.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa safu wima hizi','Drag to resize this row'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa safu mlalo hii','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Buruta kwenye visanduku ili kubainisha idadi ya safuwima na safu mlalo ambazo kitalu hiki kinachukua','+ Column'=>'+ Safu wima','− Column'=>'− Safuwima','+ Row'=>'+ Safu mlalo','− Row'=>'− Safu','Place'=>'Mahali','Paste coordinates or an OpenStreetMap link'=>'Bandika viwianishi au kiungo cha OpenStreetMap','On openstreetmap.org, find the place, then copy the address from the browser bar, or right-click the map and choose "Show address".'=>'Kwenye openstreetmap.org, tafuta eneo, kisha unakili anwani kutoka kwenye upau wa kivinjari, au bofya kulia kwenye ramani na uchague "Onyesha anwani".','Latitude'=>'Latitudo','Longitude'=>'Longitudo','Zoom'=>'Kuza','Name of the place'=>'Jina la eneo','Shown under the map and read out by screen readers.'=>'Inaonyeshwa chini ya ramani na kusomwa na visoma skrini.','Paste coordinates (for example 51.5074, -0.1278) or an OpenStreetMap link.'=>'Bandika viwianishi (kwa mfano 51.5074, -0.1278) au kiungo cha OpenStreetMap.','Coordinates or link'=>'Kuratibu au kiungo','Preview the map'=>'Kagua ramani','Check %1$s, %2$s on OpenStreetMap'=>'Angalia %1$s, %2$s kwenye OpenStreetMap','Published date'=>'Tarehe ya kuchapishwa','Updated date (when it differs)'=>'Tarehe ya kusasishwa (inapotofautiana)','Tags'=>'Lebo','Reading time'=>'Muda wa kusoma','Comment count'=>'Idadi ya maoni','Details to show'=>'Maelezo ya kuonyesha','Choose at least one detail to show.'=>'Chagua angalau maelezo moja ya kuonyesha.','Progress bar'=>'Upau wa maendeleo','Maximum'=>'Upeo','100 for a percentage; any other number for a count, such as 8 of 10.'=>'100 kwa asilimia; nambari nyingine yoyote kwa ajili ya hesabu, kama vile 8 kati ya 10.','Show the percentage'=>'Onyesha asilimia','A password is set. Visitors see a password form instead of this content until they enter it.'=>'Nenosiri limewekwa. Wageni huona fomu ya nenosiri badala ya maudhui haya hadi walipoingiza.','No password is set yet, so visitors see nothing here.'=>'Bado hakuna nenosiri lililowekwa, kwa hivyo wageni hawaoni chochote hapa.','New password'=>'Nenosiri jipya','Set the password'=>'Weka nenosiri','Password set. Save the page to apply it; visitors who had unlocked it will need the new one.'=>'Nenosiri limewekwa. Hifadhi ukurasa ili kulitumia; wageni ambao walikuwa wameufungua watahitaji jipya.','If Page Builder Sandwich is ever switched off, this content is shown to everyone.'=>'Ikiwa Page Builder Sandwich itawahi kuzimwa, maudhui haya yataonyeshwa kwa kila mtu.','Message above the password form (optional)'=>'Ujumbe ulio juu ya fomu ya nenosiri (ya hiari)','A/B test'=>'Jaribio la A/B','Test name'=>'Jina la jaribio','Visitors who see version B (%)'=>'Wageni wanaoona toleo la B (%)','Goal (optional)'=>'Lengo (hiari)','A conversion is a click on a link or button, or a form sent, inside the version. To count a click elsewhere on the page instead, enter its CSS selector, for example #buy-now.'=>'Ubadilishaji ni kubofya kiungo au kitufe, au fomu iliyotumwa, ndani ya toleo. Ili kuhesabu badala yake kubofya kwingineko kwenye ukurasa, weka kiteuzi chake cha CSS, kwa mfano #buy-now.','See the results'=>'Tazama matokeo','An A/B test needs exactly two versions.'=>'Jaribio la A/B linahitaji matoleo mawili kamili.','Button'=>'Kitufe','Visit site'=>'Tembelea tovuti','Style'=>'Mtindo','Affiliate button'=>'Kitufe cha mshirika','Give the button its text and the offer’s address in the sidebar.'=>'Weka maandishi ya kitufe na anwani ya toleo kwenye upau wa kando.','Age check'=>'Uhakiki wa umri','Put this block on every page that needs it, or in your header template part to cover the whole site.'=>'Weka kizuizi hiki kwenye kila ukurasa unaokihitaji, au kwenye sehemu ya kiolezo cha kichwa chako ili kufunika tovuti nzima.','Minimum age'=>'Umri wa chini','Ask for'=>'Omba','A yes or no answer'=>'Jibu la ndiyo au hapana','The date of birth'=>'Tarehe ya kuzaliwa','Remember the answer for (days)'=>'Kumbuka jibu kwa (siku)','Texts'=>'Maandishi','Leave a text empty to use the standard one. {age} is replaced by the minimum age.'=>'Acha maandishi wazi ili kutumia yale ya kawaida. {age} inabadilishwa na umri wa chini zaidi.','Question'=>'Swali','When the visitor is too young'=>'Wakati mgeni ni mdogo sana','Countries'=>'Nchi','A different minimum age for visitors from a country, or 0 to close the site to it. The country comes from your host or CDN (for example Cloudflare); where it is unknown, the minimum age above applies. A page cache must keep one copy per country for these rules to apply to cached pages.'=>'Umri tofauti wa chini kwa wageni kutoka nchi fulani, au 0 ili kufunga tovuti kwa nchi hiyo. Nchi inatambuliwa kutoka kwa seva pangishi yako au CDN (kwa mfano Cloudflare); mahali ambapo haijulikani, umri wa chini ulio hapo juu utatumika. Kache ya ukurasa lazima ihifadhi nakala moja kwa kila nchi ili sheria hizi zitumike kwenye kurasa zilizohifadhiwa.','Add a country'=>'Ongeza nchi','Country code (two letters)'=>'Msimbo wa nchi (herufi mbili)','For example US, GB, DE.'=>'Kwa mfano US, GB, DE.','Minimum age (0: closed)'=>'Umri wa chini zaidi (0: imefungwa)','Age gate'=>'Kizuizi cha umri','The age question shows here.'=>'Swali la umri linaonyeshwa hapa.','Changing words'=>'Inabadilisha maneno','Word'=>'Neno','Add a word'=>'Ongeza neno','Animated headline'=>'Kichwa chenye uhuishaji','Text before'=>'Maandishi kabla','Text after'=>'Maandishi baada ya','Effect'=>'Athari','Fade'=>'Fifia','Slide up'=>'Telezesha juu','Typing'=>'Anaandika...','Time per word (milliseconds)'=>'Muda kwa kila neno (milisekunde)','Add the words that change in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza maneno yanayobadilika katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Typewriter'=>'Mashine ya kuchapa','Words fade in'=>'Maneno hujitokeza taratibu','Words rise in'=>'Maneno yanaongezeka katika','Plays once, when the text scrolls into view. Visitors who ask their device for less motion see the text still.'=>'Hucheza mara moja, wakati maandishi yanaposogezwa na kuonekana. Wageni wanaoomba kifaa chao kipunguze msogeo huona maandishi yakiwa yametulia.','Speed'=>'Kasi','Slow'=>'Polepole','Normal'=>'Kawaida','Fast'=>'Haraka','Write the text to animate…'=>'Andika maandishi ya kuhuisha…','Audio player'=>'Kicheza sauti','Show or album name'=>'Jina la kipindi au albamu','Replace artwork'=>'Badilisha mchoro','Choose artwork'=>'Chagua kazi ya sanaa','Add an episode'=>'Ongeza kipindi','Choose audio file'=>'Chagua faili ya sauti','Replace audio file'=>'Badilisha faili ya sauti','or its address'=>'au anwani yake','Add episodes in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza vipindi kwenye upau wa kando.','Author box'=>'Kisanduku cha mwandishi','Picture size (pixels)'=>'Ukubwa wa picha (pikseli)','Link to the author’s posts'=>'Kiungo cha machapisho ya mwandishi','Link to their website'=>'Kiungo cha tovuti yao','Name as'=>'Taja kama','Heading 2'=>'Kichwa 2','Heading 3'=>'Kichwa cha habari 3','Heading 4'=>'Kichwa cha habari 4','Paragraph'=>'Aya','The author of the post shows here.'=>'Mwandishi wa chapisho anaonekana hapa.','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Husomwa na visoma skrini, na huonyeshwa wakati "Onyesha lebo" imewashwa.','Show label'=>'Onyesha lebo','Corner'=>'Kona','End (right in English)'=>'Mwisho (kulia kwa Kiingereza)','Start (left in English)'=>'Anza (imeachwa kwa Kiingereza)','Appear after scrolling (pixels)'=>'Onyesha baada ya kusogeza (pikseli)','Before: alternative text'=>'Kabla: maandishi mbadala','Before: label'=>'Kabla: lebo','After: alternative text'=>'Baada ya: maandishi mbadala','After: label'=>'Baada ya: lebo','Slider'=>'Kitelezi','Starting position (%)'=>'Nafasi ya kuanzia (%)','Before and after'=>'Kabla na baada','Choose the two images in the block settings. Use images of the same size.'=>'Chagua picha hizo mbili katika mipangilio ya kizuizi. Tumia picha za ukubwa sawa.','Start with the home page'=>'Anza na ukurasa wa nyumbani','Home page label'=>'Lebo ya ukurasa wa nyumbani','Separator'=>'Kitenganishi','Chevron ›'=>'Shevroni ›','Slash /'=>'Mkwaju /','Arrow →'=>'Mshale →','Dot ·'=>'Nukta ·','End with the current page'=>'Maliza na ukurasa wa sasa','Structured data for search engines'=>'Data zilizopangwa kwa ajili ya injini za utafutaji','Adds BreadcrumbList data to the page. Turn it off if an SEO plugin already adds breadcrumb data.'=>'Huongeza data ya BreadcrumbList kwenye ukurasa. Zima ikiwa programu-jalizi ya SEO tayari inaongeza data ya mkate.','The path to the current page shows here. The home page has none.'=>'Njia ya kuelekea ukurasa wa sasa inaonyeshwa hapa. Ukurasa wa nyumbani hauna.','Remove these hours on %s'=>'Ondoa saa hizi mnamo %s','Add hours (for a break)'=>'Ongeza saa (kwa ajili ya mapumziko)','Copy Monday to Tuesday–Friday'=>'Nakili Jumatatu hadi Jumanne–Ijumaa','Hours that end after midnight (18:00 to 02:00) belong to the day they start. Times are in the site’s time zone (Settings › General).'=>'Saa zinazoishia baada ya usiku wa manane (18:00 hadi 02:00) ni za siku zinapoanza. Majira yako katika eneo la saa la tovuti (Settings › General).','Display'=>'Onyesha','Empty: read out by screen readers only.'=>'Tupu: husomwa na visoma skrini pekee.','Say whether it is open now'=>'Sema ikiwa imefunguliwa sasa','Highlight today'=>'Angazia leo','Note under the hours'=>'Ujumbe chini ya saa','Closed on public holidays.'=>'Imefungwa siku za likizo za umma.','Offers'=>'Ofa','Add an offer'=>'Ongeza ofa','New offer'=>'Ofa mpya','Table'=>'Jedwali','Caption'=>'Maelezo mafupi','Shown above the table and read out by screen readers.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya jedwali na kusomwa na visoma skrini.','Rank column'=>'Safu wima ya nafasi','Rating column'=>'Safu wima ya ukadiriaji','Highlights column'=>'Safu wima ya mambo muhimu','Notice under the table'=>'Taarifa chini ya jedwali','Casino comparison table'=>'Jedwali la kulinganisha kasino','Add the offers in the sidebar, best first.'=>'Ongeza ofa kwenye upau wa kando, bora kwanza.','Kind'=>'Aina','Bars'=>'Pau','Line'=>'Mstari','Pie (first series only)'=>'Duara (safu ya kwanza tu)','Shown above the chart and read out as its name.'=>'Inaonyeshwa juu ya chati na kusomwa kama jina lake.','Before each value'=>'Kabla ya kila thamani','For example $ or €.'=>'Kwa mfano $ au €.','After each value'=>'Baada ya kila thamani','For example kg, or the percent sign.'=>'Kwa mfano kg, au alama ya asilimia.','Show a legend'=>'Onyesha maelezo mafupi','Print each value on the chart'=>'Chapisha kila thamani kwenye chati','Height'=>'Kimo','Short'=>'Fupi','Tall'=>'Ndefu','Add categories and numbers below to draw the chart.'=>'Ongeza kategoria na nambari hapa chini ili kuchora chati.','Add category'=>'Ongeza aina','Add series'=>'Ongeza mfululizo','Click to share quote'=>'Bofya ili kushiriki nukuu','Quote'=>'Nukuu','X username'=>'Jina la mtumiaji wa X','Added as "via @name". Without the @.'=>'Imeongezwa kama "via @name". Bila @.','Link to share'=>'Kiungo cha kushiriki','Left empty, the address of this page.'=>'Ikiachwa wazi, anwani ya ukurasa huu.','Write the quote in the block settings.'=>'Andika nukuu katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Content switcher'=>'Kibadilisha maudhui','Name for screen readers'=>'Jina la visoma skrini','What the switch chooses, for example "Billing period".'=>'Kile ambacho swichi huchagua, kwa mfano "Kipindi cha malipo".','Add an option'=>'Ongeza chaguo','Countdown'=>'Muda uliosalia','Count down to'=>'Kuhesabu kurudi nyuma hadi','A date and time'=>'Tarehe na wakati','A time after each visitor arrives'=>'Muda fulani baada ya kila mgeni kuwasili','Ends at'=>'Inaisha saa','In the time zone set under Settings, General.'=>'Katika ukanda wa saa uliowekwa chini ya Mipangilio, Jumla.','Hours after the first visit'=>'Saa kadhaa baada ya ziara ya kwanza','Text above'=>'Maandishi ya juu','Text once it has ended'=>'Maandishi mara yatakapokwisha','Show seconds'=>'Onyesha sekunde','Choose the date and time it counts down to.'=>'Chagua tarehe na saa ambazo muda unahesabiwa kuelekea.','Counter'=>'Kaunta','Count to'=>'Hesabu hadi','Count from'=>'Hesabu kuanzia','Decimal places'=>'Nafasi za desimali','Before the number'=>'Kabla ya nambari','For example "$".'=>'Kwa mfano "$".','After the number'=>'Baada ya nambari','For example "+" or "%".'=>'Kwa mfano "+" au "%".','Thousands separator'=>'Kitenganishi cha maelfu','Counting time (milliseconds)'=>'Muda wa kuhesabu (milisekunde)','Set the number to count to.'=>'Weka nambari ya kuhesabu hadi.','Coupon code'=>'Kodi ya kuponi','Expires'=>'Inaisha muda','As you want it shown, for example "31 December".'=>'Jinsi unavyotaka ionyeshwe, kwa mfano "31 Desemba".','Enter the code in the block settings.'=>'Weka msimbo kwenye mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Prices'=>'Bei','Show as'=>'Onyesha kama','Scrolling ticker'=>'Kitelezi cha maandishi','Cards'=>'Kadi','Price chart (one coin)'=>'Chati ya bei (sarafu moja)','Period'=>'Kipindi','24 hours'=>'Saa 24','7 days'=>'Siku 7','30 days'=>'Siku 30','90 days'=>'Siku 90','Currency'=>'Sarafu','Coins'=>'Sarafu','Prices come from CoinGecko and are kept on your site for a few minutes, so visitors never wait for it.'=>'Bei zinatoka CoinGecko na huhifadhiwa kwenye tovuti yako kwa dakika chache, kwa hivyo wageni hawaisubiri kamwe.','Crypto prices'=>'Bei za sarafu fiche','Choose the coins in the sidebar.'=>'Chagua sarafu kwenye upau wa kando.','Cursor effect'=>'Athari ya kielekezi','A ring follows the pointer'=>'Pete inafuata kielekezi','A soft spotlight'=>'Mwangaza laini','A trail of dots'=>'Msururu wa vitone','Where'=>'Wapi','Over this section'=>'Juu ya sehemu hii','Over the whole page'=>'Kwenye ukurasa mzima','The real pointer always stays. The effect is off on touch screens and for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Kielekezi halisi hubaki kila wakati. Athari hii huzimwa kwenye skrini za kugusa na kwa wageni wanaoomba vifaa vyao kupunguza mwendo.','Switch'=>'Badilisha','Number'=>'Nambari','That has no rows under its first line. The first line is used for the column names.'=>'Haina safu wima chini ya mstari wake wa kwanza. Mstari wa kwanza unatumika kwa majina ya safu wima.','Import a CSV file'=>'Ingiza faili ya CSV','Or paste CSV'=>'Au bandika CSV','Comma, semicolon or tab separated. The first line holds the column names. Importing replaces the table.'=>'Imetenganishwa kwa koma, nuktamkato au kichupo. Mstari wa kwanza una majina ya safu wima. Kuagiza kunachukua nafasi ya jedwali.','Import pasted CSV'=>'Ingiza CSV iliyobandikwa','Says what the table shows. Screen readers announce it even when it is empty on screen.'=>'Hueleza kile jedwali linaonyesha. Visoma skrini hutamka hata ikiwa haina chochote kwenye skrini.','Visitors can sort by a column'=>'Wageni wanaweza kupanga kwa safu wima','Show a search field'=>'Onyesha sehemu ya utafutaji','First column names each row'=>'Safu wima ya kwanza inataja kila safu mlalo','Sort “%s” as'=>'Panga “%s” kama','Remove column'=>'Ondoa safu wima','Import CSV'=>'Ingiza CSV','On a narrow screen'=>'Kwenye skrini nyembamba','Each row becomes a card'=>'Kila safu wima inakuwa kadi','The table scrolls sideways'=>'Jedwali linasogezwa kando','Striped rows'=>'Safu zenye mistari','Import a spreadsheet as CSV, paste on