pe','Send to'=>'Tuma kwa','One or more addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site administrator.'=>'Anwani moja au zaidi, zikitenganishwa na koma. Tupu: msimamizi wa tovuti.','Save submissions on this site'=>'Hifadhi mawasilisho kwenye tovuti hii','Listed under Page Builder Sandwich → Form submissions, with a CSV export.'=>'Imeorodheshwa chini ya Page Builder Sandwich → Mawasilisho ya fomu, ikiwa na uhamishaji wa CSV.','Send each submission to a webhook address'=>'Tuma kila uwasilishaji kwa anwani ya webhook','Webhook address (https)'=>'Anwani ya webhook (https)','Add to a mailing list'=>'Ongeza kwenye orodha ya barua pepe','Connect Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit or ActiveCampaign first.'=>'Unganisha Mailchimp, Brevo, MailerLite, Kit au ActiveCampaign kwanza.','Marketing settings'=>'Mipangilio ya masoko','Choose a service'=>'Chagua huduma','The visitor is added with the first email field of the form (and a field named "name", if there is one).'=>'Mgeni anaongezwa kwa sehemu ya kwanza ya barua pepe ya fomu (na sehemu inayoitwa "name", ikiwa ipo).','Form id: %s'=>'Kitambulisho cha fomu: %s','Web address'=>'Anwani ya wavuti','Message (several lines)'=>'Ujumbe (mistari kadhaa)','Drop-down'=>'Kunjuzi','Choose one'=>'Chagua moja','Choose several'=>'Chagua kadhaa','Consent tick box'=>'Kisanduku tiki cha idhini','File upload'=>'Upakiaji wa faili','Hidden value'=>'Thamani iliyofichwa','is'=>'ni','is not'=>'siyo','contains'=>'ina','is filled in'=>'imejazwa','is empty'=>'ni tupu','Hidden:'=>'Iliyofichwa:','Field'=>'Sehemu','Field name'=>'Jina la sehemu','Used in emails, exports and webhooks. Letters, digits and underscores.'=>'Hutumika katika barua pepe, uhamishaji na webhooks. Herufi, tarakimu na mikwaju ya chini.','Help text'=>'Maandishi ya usaidizi','Width'=>'Upana','Half width'=>'Nusu upana','Placeholder'=>'Kishikilia nafasi','Choices'=>'Chaguo','One per line.'=>'Moja kwa kila mstari.','Default value'=>'Thamani chaguomsingi','Accepted files'=>'Faili zinazokubaliwa'