dhui yake','As wide as the menu bar'=>'Upana sawa na upau wa menyu','Mega menu for “%s”'=>'Menyu kuu ya "%s"','Mega menu: choose its menu item in the sidebar.'=>'Menyu kuu: chagua kipengee chake cha menyu kwenye upau wa kando.','Mini cart'=>'Kikapu kidogo','Activate WooCommerce to show the cart.'=>'Washa WooCommerce ili kuonyesha gari la ununuzi.','Phones'=>'Simu','Accordion on phones'=>'Akodioni kwenye simu','On narrow screens each tab becomes a section that opens and closes on its own.'=>'Kwenye skrini nyembamba kila kichupo huwa sehemu inayojifungua na kujifunga yenyewe.','3D model'=>'Kielelezo cha 3D','Choose a model (GLB or glTF)'=>'Chagua kielelezo (GLB au glTF)','Description (required)'=>'Maelezo (inahitajika)','What the model shows: it is what a screen reader announces.'=>'Kile ambacho kielelezo huonyesha: ndicho ambacho kisoma skrini hutangaza.','Poster image shown while it loads'=>'Picha ya bango inayoonyeshwa wakati inapakia','Turn slowly on its own'=>'Zunguka polepole yenyewe','Offer "view in your space" (AR) on phones'=>'Toa "Tazama katika eneo lako" (AR) kwenye simu','Choose a 3D model in the sidebar.'=>'Chagua muundo wa 3D kwenye upau wa kando.','Choose a menu…'=>'Chagua menyu…','Only people who can edit the site’s menus can choose one here.'=>'Watu wanaoweza kuhariri menyu za tovuti pekee ndio wanaoweza kuchagua moja hapa.','Navigation menu'=>'Menyu ya urambazaji','Choose which WordPress menu to show.'=>'Chagua menyu ya WordPress ya kuonyesha.','This site has no menus yet. Create one, then choose it here.'=>'Tovuti hii bado haina menyu. Unda moja, kisha uichague hapa.','Edit menus'=>'Hariri menyu','Tells screen reader users which menu this is, for example “Main” or “Footer”.'=>'Hueleza watumiaji wa visoma skrini menyu hii ni ipi, kwa mfano "Kuu" au "Kijachini".','Direction'=>'Mwelekeo','In a row'=>'Mfululizo','In a column'=>'Katika safu wima','Mobile menu button'=>'Kitufe cha menyu ya simu','Below this width the menu folds into a button that opens it