p'=>'Kujisajili kwa jarida','Choose the service and enter the list ID (and, for Mailchimp, the API key) in the block settings.'=>'Chagua huduma na uweke kitambulisho cha orodha (na, kwa Mailchimp, ufunguo wa API) katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Offer'=>'Ofa','Logo and link'=>'Nembo na kiungo','Under a heading of its own, choose the next level down.'=>'Chini ya kichwa chake chenyewe, chagua kiwango kinachofuata cha chini.','Age notice'=>'Taarifa ya umri','Offer card'=>'Kadi ya ofa','Give the offer a name in the sidebar.'=>'Ipe ofa jina kwenye upau wa kando.','People'=>'Watu','Add a person'=>'Ongeza mtu','Role'=>'Wajibu','Add a photo'=>'Ongeza picha','Reports to'=>'Anaripoti kwa','Nobody (top of the chart)'=>'Hakuna mtu (juu ya chati)','Add the first person in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza mtu wa kwanza kwenye utepe wa kando.','Parallax image'=>'Picha ya parallax','Describe the image; leave empty if it is only decoration.'=>'Eleza picha; acha wazi ikiwa ni kwa ajili ya mapambo tu.','Movement'=>'Mwendo','Subtle'=>'Hila','Strong'=>'Imara','Particles'=>'Chembe','How many'=>'Kiasi gani','A few'=>'Chache','Some'=>'Baadhi','Many'=>'Nyingi','Join nearby dots with lines'=>'Unganisha nukta zilizo karibu kwa mistari','The dots stop when the section is off screen, and stay still for visitors who ask their device for less motion.'=>'Nukta husimama wakati sehemu inapokuwa nje ya skrini, na hubaki bila kusogea kwa wageni wanaoomba kifaa chao kipunguze mwendo.','Dots'=>'Nukta','Dot colour (empty: the text colour)'=>'Rangi ya nukta (tupu: rangi ya maandishi)','PDF'=>'PDF','Replace PDF'=>'Badilisha PDF','Choose a PDF'=>'Chagua PDF','Choose a PDF in the sidebar.'=>'Chagua PDF kwenye upau wa kando.','Carousel'=>'Slaidi mzunguko','Buttons above the cards show one category at a time — a filterable portfolio.'=>'Vitufe vilivyo juu ya kadi huonyesha kitengo kimoja kwa wakati mmoja — jalada linaloweza kuchujwa.','More items'=>'Vipengee zaidi','Page numbers'=>'Nambari za kurasa','"Load more" button'=>'Kitufe cha "Pakia zaidi"','Card titles are'=>'Vichwa vya kadi ni','Post carousel'=>'Mzunguko wa machapisho','Your latest posts as a carousel of cards.'=>'Machapisho yako ya hivi karibuni kama kadi zinazozunguka.','Masonry posts'=>'Machapisho ya muundo wa uashi','Cards of different heights, packed into columns.'=>'Kadi za urefu tofauti, zilizopangwa katika safu wima.','Filterable portfolio'=>'Sampuli ya kazi inayoweza kuchujwa','Cards with category buttons that filter them.'=>'Kadi zilizo na vitufe vya kategoria vinavyozichuja.','Items'=>'Vipengee','Add an item'=>'Ongeza kipengee','Price list'=>'Orodha ya bei','Add an item in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza kipengee katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Plans'=>'Vifurushi','Add a plan'=>'Ongeza mpango','Plan name'=>'Jina la kifurushi','A figure such as 19 or 19.99, or a word such as Free.'=>'Nambari kama 19 au 19.99, au neno kama Free.','After the price'=>'Baada ya bei','For example "/ month". Left empty, the billing period is used.'=>'Kwa mfano "/ mwezi". Ikiachwa tupu, kipindi cha bili kitatumika.','Yearly price'=>'Bei ya mwaka','Shown when the visitor switches to yearly billing.'=>'Huonyeshwa wakati mgeni anapobadilisha hadi bili ya kila mwaka.','After the yearly price'=>'Baada ya bei ya kila mwaka','Add a feature'=>'Ongeza kipengele','Open the link in a new tab'=>'Fungua kiungo katika kichupo kipya','Highlight this plan'=>'Angazia mpango huu','A short label above the plan, such as "Most popular".'=>'Lebo fupi juu ya mpango, kama vile "Maarufu zaidi".','Pricing table'=>'Jedwali la bei','Currency symbol'=>'Alama ya sarafu','Monthly / yearly switch'=>'Kitufe cha kubadilisha kila mwezi / kila mwaka','Shows a switch when at least one plan has a yearly price.'=>'Huonyesha swichi wakati angalau mpango mmoja una bei ya mwaka.','Monthly button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe cha kila mwezi','Yearly button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe cha kila mwaka','Yearly saving'=>'Akiba ya mwaka','For example "Save 20%".'=>'Kwa mfano "Okoa 20%".