s'=>'Maoni mengi zaidi','Random'=>'Nasibu','A custom field (text)'=>'Uga maalum (maandishi)','A custom field (number)'=>'Sehemu maalum (nambari)','Best selling'=>'Inayouzwa zaidi','Top rated'=>'Iliyokadiriwa juu','Joined'=>'Amejiunga','What to list'=>'Cha kuorodhesha','Posts, pages or products'=>'Machapisho, kurasa au bidhaa','Authors'=>'Waandishi','Categories, tags or terms'=>'Vitengo, vitambulisho au masharti','A repeater, gallery or relationship field'=>'Uga wa kirudia, ghala au uhusiano','Use the page’s own list (archives, search)'=>'Tumia orodha ya ukurasa wenyewe (nyaraka, utafutaji)','For archive and search templates: list what the visitor is browsing.'=>'Kwa violezo vya kumbukumbu na utafutaji: orodhesha kile ambacho mgeni anavinjari.','Only with this custom field (key)'=>'Ni kwa uga huu maalum (ufunguo) tu','Compared'=>'Imelinganishwa','Leave out the post being viewed'=>'Acha chapisho linalotazamwa','Hide empty ones'=>'Ficha tupu','Field plugin'=>'Programu-jalizi ya sehemu','Each row, image or related post becomes a card. In the card, bind blocks to “Custom field” with the field plugin “This row”.'=>'Kila safu mlalo, picha au chapisho linalohusiana huwa kadi. Kwenye kadi, funganisha vizuizi kwenye "Custom field" kwa kutumia programu-jalizi ya sehemu ya "This row".','Field key to sort by'=>'Ufunguo wa uga wa kupanga kwayo','Order'=>'Mpangilio','Descending'=>'Kushuka','Ascending'=>'Kupanda','Items per page'=>'Vipengee kwa kila ukurasa','Layout and pages'=>'Mpangilio na kurasa','One page only'=>'Ukurasa mmoja tu','Previous and next'=>'Iliyopita na inayofuata','Message when nothing matches'=>'Ujumbe wakati hakuna kinacholingana','Filters for visitors'=>'Vichujio vya wageni','Filters go'=>'Tumia vichujio','Above the list'=>'Juu ya orodha','Beside the list'=>'Kando ya orodha','Filter without reloading the page'=>'Chuja bila kupakia upya ukurasa','Designing the card: %d item matches on the first page.'=>'Kubuni kadi: kipengee %d kinalingana kwenye ukurasa wa kwanza.' . "\0" . 'Kusanifu kadi: vipengee %d vinalingana kwenye ukurasa wa kwanza.','Optional, for example “Reading time:”.'=>'Hiari, kwa mfano "Muda wa kusoma:".','Format'=>'Muundo','5 minutes read'=>'Usomaji wa dakika 5','5 min read'=>'Dakika 5 za kusoma','Reading speed (words a minute)'=>'Kasi ya kusoma (maneno kwa dakika)','How long the post takes to read shows here.'=>'Muda unaotumika kusoma chapisho unaonyeshwa hapa.','Score'=>'Alama','Overall score'=>'Alama ya jumla','Verdict'=>'Uamuzi','Criteria'=>'Vigezo','Add a criterion'=>'Ongeza kigezo','Criterion'=>'Kigezo','Set the score in the sidebar.'=>'Weka alama kwenye upau wa kando.','Reviews'=>'Maoni','Google and Trustpilot'=>'Google na Trustpilot','Lowest rating shown'=>'Ukadiriaji wa chini kabisa unaoonyeshwa','Only 5-star reviews.'=>'Maoni ya nyota 5 pekee.','Reviews below this are not shown.'=>'Tathmini zilizo chini ya hii hazionyeshwi.','Newest first'=>'Mpya zaidi kwanza','Best first'=>'Bora kwanza','Show the date'=>'Onyesha tarehe','Show the overall rating under them'=>'Onyesha ukadiriaji wa jumla chini yake','Google and Trustpilot details (Site design › Reviews)'=>'Maelezo ya Google na Trustpilot (Muundo wa tovuti › Ukaguzi)','A grid of cards'=>'Gridi ya kadi','A slider'=>'Kitelezi','A badge: the overall rating'=>'Beji: ukadiriaji wa jumla','Notice'=>'Taarifa','Help link'=>'Kiungo cha usaidizi','Show the age badge'=>'Onyesha beji ya umri','Link the national help service'=>'Unganisha huduma ya msaada ya kitaifa','For visitors from the UK, the US, Australia, Germany, France and Sweden, link that country’s help service. Check them against your licence, and add other countries below.'=>'Kwa wageni kutoka Uingereza, US, Australia, Ujerumani, Ufaransa na Uswidi, unganisha huduma ya usaidizi ya nchi hiyo. Iangalie kulingana na leseni yako, na uongeze nchi zingine hapa chini.','Responsible gambling notice'=>'Taarifa ya kucheza kamari kwa uwajibikaji','The notice shows here.'=>'Taarifa inaonekana hapa.','For example “Q3 2026” or “Spring”.'=>'Kwa mfano “Q3 2026” au “Masika”.','A board: planned, in progress, done'=>'Ubao: imepangwa, inaendelea, imekamilika','One list, each item with its status'=>'Orodha moja, kila kipengee kikiwa na hali yake','Column heading level'=>'Kiwango cha kichwa cha safu wima','Add the first item in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza kipengee cha kwanza kwenye upau wa kando.','Hidden labels are still read out by screen readers.'=>'Lebo zilizofichwa bado zinasomwa na visoma skrini.','Icon instead of button text'=>'Aikoni badala ya maandishi ya kitufe','Search in'=>'Tafuta katika','The whole website'=>'Tovuti nzima','Device share menu'=>'Menyu ya kushiriki ya kifaa','Share to'=>'Shiriki kwa','Share bar'=>'Upau wa kushiriki','For example "Share". Left empty, no label is shown.'=>'Kwa mfano "Share". Ikiachwa tupu, hakuna lebo inayoonyeshwa.','Floating at the side (wide screens)'=>'Inayoelea kando (skrini pana)','The buttons appear once the page has an address (save it as a draft).'=>'Vitufe vitaonekana pindi ukurasa utakapokuwa na anwani (uhifadhi kama rasimu).','Networks'=>'Mitandao','Device share button'=>'Kitufe cha kushiriki kifaa','Phones and some browsers offer their own share sheet; the button appears only where one exists.'=>'Simu na baadhi ya vivinjari hutoa laha yao ya kushiriki; kitufe huonekana pale tu ambapo ipo.','Look'=>'Mwonekano','Show network names'=>'Onyesha majina ya mtandao','Shape'=>'Umbo','Rounded'=>'Iliyoviringirishwa','Circle'=>'Duara','Square'=>'Mraba','Edit images (%d)'=>'Hariri picha (%d)','Choose images'=>'Chagua picha','Content type'=>'Aina ya maudhui','Only these categories'=>'Makundi haya tu','None chosen: every category.'=>'Hakuna iliyochaguliwa: kila kitengo.','Oldest first'=>'Ya zamani zaidi kwanza','Title, A to Z'=>'Kichwa, A hadi Z','Recently updated'=>'Iliyosasishwa hivi karibuni','Custom order'=>'Mpangilio maalum','Summary'=>'Muhtasari','Price (products)'=>'Bei (bidhaa)','Card'=>'Kadi','Previous and next buttons'=>'Vitufe vya awali n