'=>'Pitia kiungo kifupi','Visitors see a short address on your site, and every click is counted in Short links.'=>'Wageni huona anwani fupi kwenye tovuti yako, na kila mbofyo huhesabiwa katika Viungo vifupi.','Visitors will see %s'=>'Wageni wataona %s','Or make a new one, named'=>'Au unda mpya, yenye jina','spin-palace'=>'spin-palace','Create short link from the address'=>'Tengeneza kiungo kifupi kutoka kwa anwani','The page’s own content (block or classic cart and checkout)'=>'Maudhui ya ukurasa yenyewe (kikapu cha vitalu au cha kawaida na malipo)','Cart (classic)'=>'Kikapu (cha kawaida)','Checkout (classic)'=>'Malipo (ya asili)','Order received details'=>'Maelezo ya agizo lililopokelewa','Shop page'=>'Ukurasa wa duka','Height before the button'=>'Kimo kabla ya kitufe','Button text when open'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe kikiwa wazi','Sticky'=>'Iliyobandikwa','Stays at the top of the screen while visitors scroll.'=>'Hukaa juu ya skrini wakati wageni wanaposogeza ukurasa.','Transparent'=>'Wazi','Lies over the first section of the page, and takes the site’s background colour once the page scrolls. Give the first section enough space at the top.'=>'Hukaa juu ya sehemu ya kwanza ya ukurasa, na huchukua rangi ya usuli ya tovuti mara tu ukurasa unaposhushwa. Weka nafasi ya kutosha sehemu ya juu ya sehemu ya kwanza.','Slides come from'=>'Slaidi zinatoka kwa','Blocks I add'=>'Vitalu ninavyoongeza','Posts'=>'Machapisho','Products (WooCommerce)'=>'Bidhaa (WooCommerce)','Slide'=>'Slaidi','Ken Burns (slow zoom, images)'=>'Ken Burns (kuza polepole, picha)','Slides in view: desktop'=>'Slaidi zinazoonekana: kompyuta','Slides in view: tablet'=>'Slaidi zinazoonekana: kompyuta kibao','Slides in view: phone'=>'Slaidi zinazoonekana: simu','What the slides are, for example "Customer stories".'=>'Slaidi ni nini, kwa mfano "Hadithi za wateja".','Image slider'=>'Kitelezi cha picha','Images from the media library, one after another.'=>'Picha kutoka maktaba ya vyombo vya habari, moja baada ya nyingine.','Post slider'=>'Slaidi ya machapisho','Product slider'=>'Slaidi ya bidhaa','WooCommerce products as a carousel.'=>'Bidhaa za WooCommerce kama jukwaa la kuteleza.','Ken Burns slideshow'=>'Onyesho la slaidi la Ken Burns','Full-width images with a slow zoom, fading from one to the next.'=>'Picha za upana kamili zenye ukuzaji wa polepole, zikififia kutoka moja hadi nyingine.','Recent sales notices — example, shown only in the editor'=>'Arifa za mauzo ya hivi karibuni — mfano, inaonyeshwa kwenye kihariri pekee','First name from Town bought Product'=>'Jina la kwanza kutoka Mji alinunua Bidhaa','2 hours ago'=>'Saa 2 zilizopita','Orders'=>'Maagizo','Orders from'=>'Maagizo kutoka','WooCommerce and Easy Digital Downloads'=>'WooCommerce na Easy Digital Downloads','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Easy Digital Downloads'=>'Vipakuliwa Rahisi vya Dijitali','Most recent orders to show'=>'Maagizo ya hivi karibuni ya kuonyesha','Oldest order (days)'=>'Agizo la zamani zaidi (siku)','Name the product'=>'Taja bidhaa','Say how long ago'=>'Sema ni muda gani uliopita','Timing and place'=>'Wakati na mahali','Each notice shows for (seconds)'=>'Kila taarifa huonyeshwa kwa (sekunde)','Pause between notices (seconds)'=>'Kipindi kati ya arifa (sekunde)','Bottom, reading start'=>'Chini, mwanzo wa kusoma','Bottom, reading end'=>'Chini, mwisho wa usomaji','Where the notices come from'=>'Taarifa zinapotoka','Only real, paid orders are shown, and only when the buyer ticked the box at checkout that lets this site show their first name and town. Once this page is saved, the checkout offers that box. Until an order with it arrives, visitors see nothing.'=>'Ni maagizo halisi, yaliyolipwa pekee ndiyo yanayoonyeshwa, na ni pale tu mnunuzi alipoweka tiki kwenye kisanduku wakati wa kulipa kinachoruhusu tovuti hii kuonyesha jina lake la kwanza na mji wake. Ukurasa huu ukishahifadhiwa, ukurasa wa malipo utatoa kisanduku hicho. Hadi agizo lenye tiki hiyo lifike, wageni hawataona chochote.','Find the coordinates from the address'=>'Tafuta viwianishi kutoka kwa anwani','Found. Check the pin on the map on the page.'=>'Imepatikana. Angalia pini kwenye ramani kwenye ukurasa.','No match. Try the street, town and postcode, or type the coordinates.'=>'Hakuna linalolingana. Jaribu mtaa, mji na msimbo wa posta, au andika viwianishi.','OpenStreetMap did not answer. Try again in a minute, or type the coordinates.'=>'OpenStreetMap haikujibu. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja, au andika viwianishi.','Sends the address to OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) and fills in the latitude and longitude.'=>'Hutuma anwani kwa OpenStreetMap (Nominatim) na kujaza latitudo na longitudo.','Locations'=>'Maeneo','Add a location'=>'Ongeza eneo','Search and “Nearest to me”'=>'Tafuta na “Iliyo karibu zaidi nami”','Offer a map'=>'Toa ramani','Visitors press “Show the map” first: nothing loads from OpenStreetMap until they do.'=>'Wageni hubonyeza "Onyesha ramani" kwanza: hakuna kinachopakiwa kutoka OpenStreetMap hadi wafanye hivyo.','Map zoom (0 = fit every location)'=>'Ukuzaji wa ramani (0 = kutoshea kila eneo)','Add the first location in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza eneo la kwanza kwenye upau wa kando.','Pane'=>'Kidirisha','Name on the switch'=>'Jina kwenye swichi','Person'=>'Mtu','Short bio'=>'Wasifu mfupi','Photo'=>'Picha','Photo: alternative text'=>'Picha: maandishi mbadala','Leave empty when the photo only repeats the name.'=>'Acha wazi wakati picha inarudia jina pekee.','Profile links'=>'Viungo vya wasifu','Add a link'=>'Ongeza kiungo','Network'=>'Mtandao','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','X'=>'X','Facebook'=>'Facebook','Instagram'=>'Instagram','GitHub'=>'GitHub','YouTube'=>'YouTube','Mastodon'=>'Mastodon','Bluesky'=>'Bluesky','Add a person in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza mtu katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Event'=>'Tukio','Add an event in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza tukio katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Badges'=>'Beji','Add a badge'=>'Ongeza beji','Trust badges'=>'Beji za uaminifu','Row'=>'Safu mlalo','Add a badge in the block settings.'=>'Ongeza beji katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Videos'=>'Video','Add a video'=>'Ongeza video','Video address (YouTube, Vimeo or a file)'=>'Anwani ya video (YouTube, Vimeo au faili)','Poster image (optional)'=>'Picha ya bango (ya hiari)','Replace poster'=>'Badilisha bango','Add videos in the sidebar.'=>'Ongeza video kwenye upau wa kando.','Name of the list'=>'Jina la orodha','Web address or text'=>'Anwani ya wavuti au maandishi','QR code'=>'Msimbo wa QR','Description for screen readers'=>'Maelezo ya visoma skrini','Leave empty to use "QR code for" and the text.'=>'Acha wazi ili kutumia "QR code for" na maandishi.','Type a web address, a phone link (tel:) or any text.'=>'Andika anwani ya tovuti, kiungo cha simu (tel:) au maandishi yoyote.','This is too long for a QR code. Shorten it.'=>'Hii ni ndefu mno kwa msimbo wa QR. Ifupishe.','Add a caption'=>'Weka maelezo mafupi','Reading progress bar'=>'Upau wa maendeleo ya usomaji','Edge of the window'=>'Ukingo wa dirisha','Top'=>'Juu','Bottom'=>'Chini','Shown along the bottom of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Inaonyeshwa chini ya dirisha wageni wanaposogeza.','Shown along the top of the window as visitors scroll.'=>'Huonyeshwa juu ya dirisha kadiri wageni wanavyosogeza chini au juu.','Related by'=>'Kuhusiana na','Categories or tags'=>'Vitengo au lebo','When nothing is related, show the newest instead'=>'Wakati hakuna kitu kinachohusiana, onyesha kipya zaidi badala yake','Leave empty for "Related posts".'=>'Acha wazi kwa ajili ya "Machapisho yanayohusiana".','Show the featured image'=>'Onyesha picha iliyoangaziwa','Show a summary'=>'Onyesha muhtasari','No posts share this post’s categories or tags yet. When some do, they show here.'=>'Hakuna machapisho yanayoshiriki kategoria au lebo za chapisho hili bado. Yatakapokuwepo, yataonyeshwa hapa.','Modal'=>'Modali','Off-canvas panel'=>'Paneli ya nje','Slides in from'=>'Huteleza kutoka','Start is the side where reading begins: the left in English, the right in Arabic.'=>'Mwanzo ni upande ambapo usomaji huanzia: kushoto kwa Kiingereza, kulia kwa Kiarabu.','Close when the page behind is clicked'=>'Funga ukurasa wa nyuma unapobofya','Title of the window'=>'Kichwa cha dirisha','Check mark'=>'Alama ya kuteua','Cross'=>'Msalaba','Dot'=>'Nukta','Arrow'=>'Mshale','Star'=>'Weka nyota','Icon colour'=>'Rangi ya aikoni','Same as the text'=>'Sawa na maandishi','Theme primary'=>'Mandhari ya msingi','Theme secondary'=>'Mandhari ya pili','Theme contrast'=>'Tofauti ya mandhari','Keep headings in order down the page: a heading one level below the section it sits in.'=>'Weka vichwa vya habari kwa mfuatano chini ya ukurasa: kichwa cha habari kinapaswa kuwa kiwango kimoja chini ya sehemu kilimowekwa.','Choose icon'=>'Chagua aikoni','Use the default icon'=>'Tumia aikoni chaguo-msingi','Choose an icon'=>'Chagua aikoni','Show a heading for each type'=>'Onyesha kichwa cha habari kwa kila aina','Nothing published yet in the types you chose.'=>'Bado hakuna kilichochapishwa katika aina ulizochagua.','Links'=>'Viungo','Link %d'=>'Kiungo %d','A profile address, mailto:you@example.com or tel:+441234567890.'=>'Anwani ya wasifu, mailto:you@example.com au tel:+441234567890.','Name read to screen readers'=>'Jina linalosomwa kwa visoma skrini','Other icon'=>'Aikoni nyingine','Add link'=>'Weka kiungo','Icon only'=>'Aikoni pekee','Rounded square'=>'Mraba ulioviringishwa pembe','Open profiles in a new tab'=>'Fungua wasifu katika kichupo kipya','Star rating'=>'Ukadiriaji wa nyota','Number of stars'=>'Idadi ya nyota','Show the number'=>'Onyesha nambari','Down the page'=>'Chini kwenye ukurasa','Side by side (stacks on phones)'=>'Sambamba (inapangwa juu-chini kwenye simu)','Number colour'=>'Rangi ya nambari','Order of the steps'=>'Mpangilio wa hatua','Step %d'=>'Hatua %d','Step…'=>'Hatua…','What to do…'=>'Nini cha kufanya…','Add step'=>'Ongeza hatua','Tab'=>'Kichupo','Add headings to the page and they will be listed here.'=>'Ongeza vichwa vya habari kwenye ukurasa na vitaorodheshwa hapa.','Table of contents'=>'Yaliyomo','From heading level'=>'Kutoka kiwango cha kichwa cha habari','To heading level'=>'Hadi kiwango cha kichwa cha habari','Numbered'=>'Yenye nambari','Can be collapsed'=>'Inaweza kukunjwa','Start collapsed'=>'Anza kikiwa kimekunjwa','Highlight the section being read'=>'Angazia sehemu inayosoma','Optional. Says what the tabs are about, for example "Plans".'=>'Hiari. Hufafanua madhumuni ya vichupo, kwa mfano "Mipango".','Open on page load'=>'Fungua ukurasa unapopakiwa','Tabs down the side'=>'Vichupo kando','Add a tab'=>'Ongeza kichupo','Testimonial'=>'Ushuhuda','Choose photo'=>'Chagua picha','Remove photo'=>'Ondoa picha','Photo description'=>'Maelezo ya picha','Leave empty when the photo only shows the person named next to it.'=>'Acha wazi wakati picha inamuonyesha tu mtu aliyetajwa kando yake.','Star rating (0 = none)'=>'Ukadiriaji wa nyota (0 = hakuna)','Name under the quote'=>'Jina chini ya nukuu','Photo beside the quote'=>'Picha kando ya nukuu','What the customer said…'=>'Alichosema mteja…','Role or company'=>'Wajibu au kampuni','Tooltip'=>'Kidokezo cha zana','Tooltip text'=>'Maandishi ya kidokezo','Keep it short: one or two sentences. Screen readers read it with the word it explains.'=>'Ifanye iwe fupi: sentensi moja au mbili. Visoma skrini huvisoma pamoja na neno linaloelezwa.','Show it'=>'Ionyeshe','Above'=>'Juu','Below'=>'Chini','Word or phrase'=>'Neno au kifungu cha maneno','Profile'=>'Wasifu','Whose profile'=>'Wasifu wa nani','The post’s author'=>'Mwandishi wa chapisho','Show the profile picture'=>'Onyesha picha ya wasifu','Show the biography'=>'Onyesha wasifu','Show links to posts and website'=>'Onyesha viungo vya machapisho na tovuti','Author profile'=>'Wasifu wa mwandishi','Choose whose profile to show.'=>'Chagua jalada la nani lionyeshwe.','WhatsApp number, with country code'=>'Nambari ya WhatsApp, ikiwa na msimbo wa nchi','For example +44 7700 900123.'=>'Kwa mfano +44 7700 900123.','Message to start with (optional)'=>'Ujumbe wa kuanzia (hiari)','Show the text next to the icon'=>'Onyesha maandishi kando ya aikoni','Bottom end (right in English)'=>'Mwisho wa chini (kulia kwa Kiingereza)','Bottom start (left in English)'=>'Chini mwanzo (kushoto kwa Kiingereza)','Add your WhatsApp number in the sidebar. Until then the button is not shown on the page.'=>'Weka nambari yako ya WhatsApp kwenye upau wa kando. Hadi wakati huo kitufe hakitaonyeshwa kwenye ukurasa.','On the page, this button floats in a bottom corner of the screen.'=>'Kwenye ukurasa, kitufe hiki huelea kwenye kona ya chini ya skrini.','Saved to your cloud library.'=>'Imehifadhiwa kwenye maktaba yako ya wingu.','Save to cloud library'=>'Hifadhi kwenye maktaba ya wingu','Save to'=>'Hifadhi kwenye','Images are resized, stored once and brought back into the media library of any site that inserts this design.'=>'Picha hubadilishwa ukubwa, huhifadhiwa mara moja na kurejeshwa kwenye maktaba ya maudhui ya tovuti yoyote inayoweka muundo huu.','%s style'=>'Mtindo wa %s','Save style to cloud library'=>'Hifadhi mtindo kwenye maktaba ya wingu','Select a block first, then apply the style.'=>'Chagua kizuizi kwanza, kisha utumie mtindo.','Library'=>'Maktaba','Save this page to the library'=>'Hifadhi ukurasa huu kwenye maktaba','Insert'=>'Chomeka','Shortcode tag'=>'Lebo ya msimbo mfupi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Tumia herufi, nambari, dashi na mistari ya chini pekee.','Attribute name'=>'Jina la sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ongeza sifa','Shortcode'=>'Msimbo mfupi','Other attributes'=>'Sifa nyingine','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Chagua lebo ya msimbo mfupi katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','Image size'=>'Ukubwa wa picha','Thumbnail'=>'Picha ndogo','Full size'=>'Ukubwa kamili','Link to'=>'Unganisha kwa','Attachment page'=>'Ukurasa wa kiambatisho','Media file'=>'Faili ya midia','Audio'=>'Sauti','Video'=>'Video','File address'=>'Anwani ya faili','Poster image'=>'Picha ya bango','Media IDs, separated by commas'=>'Vitambulisho vya midia, vikitenganishwa kwa koma','Show the track list'=>'Onyesha orodha ya nyimbo','Embed'=>'Pachika','Address to embed'=>'Anwani ya kupachika','Maximum width'=>'Upana wa juu zaidi','Image and caption HTML'=>'HTML ya picha na maelezo mafupi','Tip: the Form block shows this form styled to match your site.'=>'Kidokezo: Kitalu cha Fomu kinaonyesha fomu hii ikiwa na mtindo unaolingana na tovuti yako.','Show the form title'=>'Onyesha kichwa cha fomu','Show the form description'=>'Onyesha maelezo ya fomu','Submit without reloading the page'=>'Wasilisha bila kupakia upya ukurasa','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Kidhibiti cha "%s" kutoka kwa kihariri cha zamani hakipatikani kwenye kihariri kizuizi. Weka thamani kama maandishi.','Choose file'=>'Chagua faili','— Default —'=>'— Chaguomsingi —','Advanced styling'=>'Muundo wa hali ya juu','Inline CSS'=>'CSS ya ndani ya mstari','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Matamko ya CSS, kwa mfano: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Athari (madarasa ya zamani)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Majina ya athari yaliyotenganishwa kwa nafasi yaliyoletwa kutoka matoleo ya zamani, kwa mfano: hover-shadow','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Upana kamili, maudhui yamewekwa katikati','Link relationship'=>'Uhusiano wa kiungo','Left'=>'Kushoto','Right'=>'Kulia','Add text…'=>'Ongeza maandishi…','Placement'=>'Uwekaji','On its own line'=>'Kwenye mstari wake','In the line, beside other content'=>'Kwenye mstari, kando ya maudhui mengine','Automatic (own line at the top level of the page)'=>'Otomatiki (mstari wake wenyewe katika kiwango cha juu cha ukurasa)','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayofikika','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Acha tupu kwa ikoni ya mapambo.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Chagua aikoni katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','New setting name'=>'Jina jipya la mpangilio','For example: title or text'=>'Kwa mfano: kichwa au maandishi','Add setting'=>'Ongeza mpangilio','Widget'=>'Wijeti','Choose a widget'=>'Chagua wijeti','Widget area'=>'Eneo la wijeti','Choose a widget area'=>'Chagua eneo la wijeti','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Picha hii haina upana na urefu, kwa hivyo ukurasa utaruka unapopakia. Ichague kutoka kwenye Maktaba ya Vyombo vya Habari, au weka upana na urefu wake.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Video hii haitoki kwenye Maktaba ya Midia, kwa hivyo ukubwa wake haujulikani na ukurasa utaruka inapopakiwa. Ipakie kwenye Maktaba ya Midia badala yake.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Picha, video au fremu katika HTML hii haina upana na urefu, kwa hivyo ukurasa utaruka unapopakia. Ongeza sifa za upana na urefu kwake.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kipengele hiki kilichopachikwa hubadilisha ukubwa wake baada ya kupakia, jambo ambalo husogeza maudhui yaliyo chini yake. Kipe nafasi au kiweke chini zaidi kwenye ukurasa.','Layout shift'=>'Mabadiliko ya mpangilio','This widget does not describe its settings, so they are edited as name and value pairs.'=>'Wijeti hii haielezi mipangilio yake, kwa hivyo inahaririwa kama jozi za majina na thamani.','Problem'=>'Tatizo','Check'=>'Angalia','Show block'=>'Onyesha kizuizi','Use a readable theme colour'=>'Tumia rangi ya mandhari inayosomeka','Make it H%d'=>'Ifanye kuwa H%d','Alt text'=>'Maandishi mbadala','Save alt text'=>'Hifadhi maandishi mbadala','This image is decorative'=>'Picha hii ni ya mapambo','Checking…'=>'Inakagua…','No accessibility problems found on this page.'=>'Hakuna matatizo ya ufikiaji yaliyopatikana kwenye ukurasa huu.','%1$s, %2$s.'=>'%1$s, %2$s.','%d problem'=>'tatizo %d' . "\0" . 'matatizo %d','%d thing to check'=>'Kitu %d cha kuangalia' . "\0" . 'Mambo %d ya kuangalia','Check again'=>'Angalia tena','An automatic check finds many problems but not all of them. Also try the page with the keyboard alone and with a screen reader.'=>'Ukaguzi wa kiotomatiki hupata matatizo mengi lakini si yote. Jaribu pia ukurasa kwa kibodi pekee na kwa kisoma skrini.','Text contrast is %1$s:1; it needs at least %2$s:1 to be readable.'=>'Ulinganuzi wa maandishi ni %1$s:1; unahitaji angalau %2$s:1 ili uweze kusomeka.','click here,here,read more,more,link,this link,learn more,go'=>'bofya hapa,hapa,soma zaidi,zaidi,kiungo,kiungo hiki,jifunze zaidi,nenda','A link has no text, so a screen reader announces only “link”. Add text or a label.'=>'Kiungo hakina maandishi, kwa hivyo kisoma skrini hutangaza "kiungo" pekee. Ongeza maandishi au lebo.','The link text “%s” does not say where it goes. Describe the destination instead.'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo “%s” hayasemi yanaelekea wapi. Badala yake, eleza unakoenda.','An element has a positive tabindex, which changes the keyboard order away from the reading order. Use 0 or remove it.'=>'Kipengele kina tabindex chanya, ambayo hubadilisha mpangilio wa kibodi kutoka kwenye mpangilio wa usomaji. Tumia 0 au uondoe.','Something clickable cannot be reached with the keyboard. Use a real button or link.'=>'Kitu kinachoweza kubofya hakiwezi kufikiwa kwa kibodi. Tumia kitufe au kiungo halisi.','An embedded frame has no title, so a screen reader cannot say what it is.'=>'Fremu iliyopachikwa haina kichwa, kwa hivyo kisoma skrini hakiwezi kusema ni nini.','A form field has no label, so its purpose is not announced.'=>'Sehemu ya fomu haina lebo, kwa hivyo madhumuni yake hayatangazwi.','This heading is empty. Screen reader users navigate by headings; remove it or add text.'=>'Kichwa hiki hakina kitu. Watumiaji wa kisoma skrini hupitia kwa vichwa; kiondoe au ongeza maandishi.','The page title is already the H1; use H2 for the top level of the content.'=>'Kichwa cha ukurasa tayari ni H1; tumia H2 kwa kiwango cha juu cha maudhui.','This H%1$d skips a level; the one before it is H%2$d. Make it an H%3$d.'=>'H%1$d hii inaruka kiwango kimoja; iliyo kabla yake ni H%2$d. Ifanye kuwa H%3$d.','This image has no alt text. Describe it, or mark it as decorative if it adds nothing.'=>'Picha hii haina maandishi mbadala. Ifafanue, au itiwe alama kama ya urembo ikiwa haiongezi chochote.','Close panel'=>'Funga paneli','Desktop'=>'Kompyuta ya mezani','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Every track'=>'Kila wimbo','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Ukubwa wa njia, kwa mfano: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Ukubwa maalum wa njia','Equal tracks'=>'Nyimbo sawa','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Safu moja iliyo kwenye alama za nukuu kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano: "head head" "side main". Taja eneo kwenye kila kizuizi cha mtoto.','Automatic'=>'Otomatiki','Square (1:1)'=>'Mraba (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Kawaida (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Kawaida (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Pana (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Ndefu (9:16)','Custom'=>'Maalum','Width / height'=>'Upana / kimo','Background image'=>'Picha ya usuli','Inherited image — replace'=>'Picha iliyorithiwa — badilisha','Cover'=>'Jalada','Contain'=>'Ina','Original size'=>'Ukubwa wa asili','Repeat'=>'Rudia','No repeat'=>'Usirudie','Tile'=>'Kigae','Tile across'=>'Panga kimlalo','Tile down'=>'Panga vigae kuelekea chini','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Imewekwa sawa wakati wa kusogeza','Solid'=>'Imara','Dashed'=>'Mistari iliyokatika','Dotted'=>'Yenye nukta','Double'=>'Maradufu','Each side separately'=>'Kila upande kando','Side'=>'Upande','Add a shadow'=>'Ongeza kivuli','H