asymmetric)'=>'Pembetatu (isiyo na ulinganifu)','Split'=>'Gawanya','Zigzag'=>'Sikizagi','Mountains'=>'Milima','Clouds'=>'Wingu','Drops'=>'Yaliyoachwa','Pyramids'=>'Piramidi','Book'=>'Weka nafasi','Stairs'=>'Ngazi','Fan'=>'Panga','Height (px)'=>'Kimo (px)','Mirror'=>'Kioo','Invert'=>'Geuza','In front of the content'=>'Mbele ya maudhui','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Faili la video (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Chagua video ya MP4 au WebM','MP4 address'=>'Anwani ya MP4','WebM address'=>'Anwani ya WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Kitambulisho cha video ya YouTube (herufi 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Nambari ya video ya Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Wageni huwasiliana na huduma ya video wanapovinjari hadi sehemu hii pekee, na kamwe sio wakati kifaa chao kinapoomba mwendo uliopunguzwa. Hadi wakati huo wanaona picha ya bango.','Replace poster image'=>'Badilisha picha ya bango','Choose poster image'=>'Chagua picha ya bango','Background slideshow'=>'Onyesho la slaidi la mandharinyuma','Change images'=>'Badilisha picha','Choose at least two images.'=>'Chagua angalau picha mbili.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekunde kwa kila picha','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Ukuzaji wa polepole (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Ondoa onyesho la slaidi','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Wageni wanaoomba kifaa chao kupunguza mwendo huona picha ya kwanza pekee.','Section effects'=>'Athari za sehemu','Top divider'=>'Kigawanyaji cha juu','Bottom divider'=>'Kigawanyaji cha chini','Choose the logo'=>'Chagua nembo','Not set'=>'Haijawekwa','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Kagua rangi za chapa: kila moja inahitaji jina la kipekee na rangi halali.','Brand name'=>'Jina la chapa','A logo is chosen.'=>'Nembo imechaguliwa.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Chagua nembo kutoka ukurasa wa muundo wa tovuti.','Brand colours'=>'Rangi za chapa','Brand %d'=>'Chapa %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ongeza rangi ya chapa','Heading font'=>'Fonti ya kichwa','Body font'=>'Fonti ya kiini cha matini','Tone of voice'=>'Toni ya usemi','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Jinsi chapa yako inavyoandika, k.m. “Kirafiki na wazi, sentensi fupi, hakuna maneno magumu.” AI huifuata wakati wowote inapoandika kwa ajili ya tovuti hii.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Seti ya chapa imehifadhiwa.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Chapa imetumika: rangi, fonti na nembo yake sasa ni za tovuti.','Apply to site'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti','All classes'=>'Madarasa yote','Class name on the page'=>'Jina la darasa kwenye ukurasa','Printed as %s.'=>'Imechapishwa kama %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Anza kwa herufi; herufi ndogo, tarakimu na vistari vifupi pekee.','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Vidhibiti vya mtindo havijapakiwa. Pakia upya ukurasa; ikiwa hali hii itaendelea, sakinisha upya programu-jalizi.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Darasa limehifadhiwa. Kila kipengele kinacholitumia kina mtindo mpya.','Save class'=>'Hifadhi darasa','Class created.'=>'Darasa limeundwa.','New class'=>'Darasa jipya','e.g. Card'=>'k.m. Kadi','Create'=>'Unda','Search classes'=>'Tafuta madarasa','No class matches.'=>'Hakuna kundi linalolingana.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Bado hakuna madarasa. Unda moja, irekebishe mtindo, kisha uiongeze kwenye kipengele chochote kutoka kwa mipangilio yake.','Edit %s'=>'Hariri %s','Class duplicated.'=>'Darasa limerudiwa.','Delete %s'=>'Futa %s','Class deleted.'=>'Darasa limefutwa.','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Futa darasa la "%s"? Vipengele vinavyolitumia vitabakiza maudhui yake na kupoteza mitindo yake.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Watumiaji wanaoweza kuongeza HTML isiyochujwa pekee ndio wanaoweza kubadilisha CSS maalum.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Baadhi ya CSS hii haitatumika: @import, expression(), URL za javascript:, "<" na mabano yasiyo na uwiano yameondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama.','Upload a font'=>'Pakia fonti','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Kupakia fonti kunahitaji WordPress 6.5 au toleo jipya zaidi.','Font name'=>'Jina la fonti','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'mf. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s imepakiwa na iko tayari kutumika.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Chagua faili ya fonti (%s)','Font library'=>'Maktaba ya fonti','%d files'=>'faili %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Fonti imezimwa kwa tovuti.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Fonti imewashwa kwa ajili ya tovuti.','Switch off'=>'Zima','Switch on'=>'Washa','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Bandika kit id ya mradi wako wa wavuti wa Adobe Fonts. Fonti zake kisha zitapakiwa kutoka Adobe kwenye kurasa zako.','Your web projects'=>'Miradi yako ya wavuti','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imeunganishwa.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imekatika.','Kit id'=>'Kit id','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Thamani ya giza kwa "%s" si rangi halali.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Wakati mgeni hajachagua','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Fuata kifaa cha mgeni','Dark colours'=>'Rangi nzito','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Ipe kila rangi toleo lake jeusi. Rangi zilizoachwa tupu hubaki vile vile katika mipangilio yote miwili. Hali nyeusi huwashwa punde tu rangi moja inapokuwa na thamani ya giza.','Dark version of %s'=>'Toleo jeusi la %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'Hali ya giza imehifadhiwa.','Page CSS'=>'CSS ya Ukurasa','Global classes'=>'Madarasa ya jumla','Classes'=>'Madarasa','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Unda madarasa katika Usanifu wa Tovuti, kisha uyaongeze hapa.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Maalum','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Andika sheria za kipengele hiki. "selector" inamaanisha kipengele hiki, k.m. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — maazimio ya kawaida hutumika kwenye kipengele chenyewe.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Faili za fonti lazima ziwe %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Faili hilo la fonti ni tupu au ni kubwa kuliko MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Sanifu mara moja, tumia tena kila mahali, badilisha mahali pamoja.','Variables'=>'Vibadili','Named values any element can use.'=>'Thamani zilizopewa majina ambazo kipengele chochote kinaweza kutumia.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Nafasi, nusukipenyo na vivuli','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Vipimo vinavyotolewa na kila kiteuzi cha nafasi, kona na kivuli.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Toleo la giza la rangi zako, kwa wageni wanaolitaka.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Nembo, rangi, fonti na mtindo wa lugha, unaotumiwa na akili mnemba na violezo.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Pakia fonti zako mwenyewe au unganisha Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS ya ukurasa huu pekee.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS ya ukurasa huu','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Hupakiwa kwenye ukurasa huu pekee, baada ya mitindo ya tovuti. Imehifadhiwa pamoja na ukurasa.','Short name'=>'Jina fupi','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Jina fupi "%s" limetumika mara mbili.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": majina mafupi hutumia herufi ndogo, tarakimu na vitenganishi.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Thamani ya "%s" haikubaliki katika mpangilio huu.','Radius'=>'Nusukipenyo','Add a step'=>'Ongeza hatua','Scales saved.'=>'Vipimo vimehifadhiwa.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Vipimo vimerudi kwenye chaguomsingi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Rejesha kwenye vipimo chaguomsingi','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Bado hakuna vigeu. Kigeu huwa na thamani moja — upana, mchanganyiko wa rangi, ukubwa wa fonti — ambayo vipengele vingi hushiriki.','Add variable'=>'Ongeza kibadilika','Variables saved.'=>'Vibadilika vimehifadhiwa.','Entrance animation'=>'Uhuishaji wa kuingia','Fade in'=>'Fifia kuingia','Fade in, rising'=>'Kuingia kwa kufifia, ikipanda','Fade in, dropping'=>'Kufifia kuingia, ikianguka','Fade in from the start side'=>'Fifia kuingia kutoka upande wa kuanzia','Fade in from the end side'=>'Kufifia kuingia kutoka upande wa mwisho','Zoom out'=>'Kuza nje','Flip up'=>'Pindua juu','Animation length (ms)'=>'Urefu wa uhuishaji (ms)','Animation delay (ms)'=>'Kuchelewa kwa uhuishaji (ms)','While scrolling'=>'Wakati wa kusogeza','Fade in as it scrolls into view'=>'Tokea taratibu inaposogezwa kwenye mwonekano','Rise as it scrolls into view'=>'Inuka inapoviringishwa kwenye mwonekano','Grow as it scrolls into view'=>'Kuza inaposhuka kwenye mwonekano','Straighten as it scrolls into view'=>'Nyoosha inaposogezwa kwenye mwonekano','On hover'=>'Wakati wa kuelekeza kipanya','Lift'=>'Inua','Glow'=>'Mwangaza','Stay in view (px from the top)'=>'Baki kwenye mwonekano (px kutoka juu)','Parallax speed (-10 to 10)'=>'Kasi ya parallax (-10 hadi 10)','Follow the pointer (strength)'=>'Fuata kielekezi (nguvu)','Place ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Mahali','Find it with Google’s Place ID finder: search for your business and copy the ID.'=>'Ipate ukitumia kitafutaji cha Place ID cha Google: tafuta biashara yako na unakili kitambulisho.','An API key from your Google Cloud project with the Places API (New) enabled. Restrict it to that API.'=>'Ufunguo wa API kutoka mradi wako wa Google Cloud uliowashwa Places API (New). Uzuie kwa API hiyo pekee.','Business unit ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kitengo cha biashara','The 24-character ID of your business on Trustpilot, from your Trustpilot Business account (Integrations › API).'=>'Kitambulisho cha herufi 24 cha biashara yako kwenye Trustpilot, kutoka kwa akaunti yako ya Trustpilot Business (Integrations › API).','The API key of your Trustpilot Business account.'=>'Kitufe cha API cha akaunti yako ya Trustpilot Business.','Not set up.'=>'Haijasanidiwa.','The saved key can no longer be read (the site’s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa hauwezi kusomwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Uingize tena.','Needs both an ID and an API key.'=>'Inahitaji kitambulisho pamoja na ufunguo wa API.','Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google’s terms do not allow keeping them).'=>'Weka mipangilio. Maoni ya Google hupakiwa papo hapo kila wakati ukurasa wenye kizuizi cha Maoni unapotazamwa: ombi moja la Place Details kwenye ufunguo wako mwenyewe kwa kila mtazamo, hayahifadhiwi kamwe (masharti ya Google hayaruhusu kuyaweka).','The first refresh failed: %s'=>'Uonyeshaji upya wa kwanza haukufaulu: %s','Waiting for the first refresh (within a minute or two).'=>'Inasubiri kuonyeshwa upya kwa mara ya kwanza (ndani ya dakika moja au mbili).','Refreshed %1$s: %2$d reviews kept, rated %3$s from %4$d.'=>'%1$s imeburudishwa: maoni %2$d yamehifadhiwa, yametathminiwa %3$s kutoka %4$d.','The last try, %1$s, failed and the reviews above were kept: %2$s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho, %1$s, lilishindikana na hakiki zilizo hapo juu zilihifadhiwa: %2$s','Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Maoni ya Trustpilot huchukuliwa chinichini ndani ya dakika moja au mbili; maoni ya Google hupakiwa moja kwa moja kwenye ukurasa.','Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.'=>'Maoni ya Trustpilot huchukuliwa mara moja kwa siku chinichini na kuhifadhiwa kwenye tovuti yako, kwa hivyo ukurasa wenye shughuli nyingi haugharimu chochote cha ziada kwenye akaunti yako ya Trustpilot; urejeshaji usipofaulu, maoni ya mwisho hubaki. Google hairuhusu maoni yake kuhifadhiwa, kwa hivyo hupakiwa papo hapo mgeni anapotazama ukurasa: kila mtazamo ni ombi moja kwenye ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa Google, unaotozwa na Google.','Where to find it'=>'Mahali pa kuipata','Saved (…%s). Type a new one to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa (…%s). Andika mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Remove the %s details and its reviews'=>'Ondoa maelezo ya %s na maoni yake','Refreshed.'=>'Imeburudishwa.','Refresh now'=>'Pakia upya sasa','Next daily refresh: %s.'=>'Onyesho upya linalofuata la kila siku: %s.','Your Google and Trustpilot details, for the Reviews block.'=>'Maelezo yako ya Google na Trustpilot, kwa ajili ya kizuizi cha Maoni.','No colours yet.'=>'Bado hakuna rangi.','Colour %d'=>'Rangi %d','Add colour'=>'Ongeza rangi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Rangi mbili zina jina sawa. Badilisha jina la moja.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" si rangi halali.','Theme colours'=>'Rangi za mandhari','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Paleiti ya mandhari yako. Mabadiliko hapa yanahifadhiwa kama toleo la tovuti yako la rangi hiyo, kwa njia ile ile ambayo Kihariri cha Tovuti huikumbuka, na inatumika kila mahali rangi hiyo inapotumika.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Rangi za mandhari zimerejeshwa kwenye thamani asili za mandhari yenyewe.','Reset theme colours'=>'Weka upya rangi za mandhari','Your colours'=>'Rangi zako','Colours saved.'=>'Rangi zimehifadhiwa.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Chagua rangi ya %s','Clear'=>'Futa','The change could not be saved.'=>'Mabadiliko hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Theme default'=>'Chaguo-msingi la mandhari','Theme fonts'=>'Fonti za mandhari','Your fonts'=>'Fonti zako','Font stack'=>'Msururu wa fonti','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Fonti iliyopakiwa: faili zake zinatoka kwenye maktaba ya fonti.','System sans-serif'=>'Sans-serif ya mfumo','Add font stack'=>'Ongeza safu ya fonti','Fonts saved.'=>'Fonti zimehifadhiwa.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Imeshirikiwa na mandhari yako na Kihariri cha Tovuti.','Fonts'=>'Fonti','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Fonti za vichwa na maandishi ya msingi kwa wavuti nzima.','Back to Site design'=>'Rudi kwenye Muundo wa tovuti','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Madarasa, tokeni, hali ya giza, seti ya chapa na fonti maalum huja na Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Fungua mitindo ya Kihariri Tovuti','A heading with a tighter line height, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Kichwa cha habari chenye urefu wa mstari uliobanana zaidi, kilichowekwa mtindo kupitia kichupo cha Mtindo.','A paragraph of text, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Aya ya maandishi, iliyoandaliwa kwa kichupo cha Style.','An image with rounded corners, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Picha yenye pembe za mviringo, iliyowekwa mtindo kupitia kichupo cha Mtindo.','A video from the Media Library, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Video kutoka Maktaba ya Vyombo vya Habari, iliyopambwa kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','Spacer'=>'Kitenganishi nafasi','Empty space between blocks; set a different height per screen size in the Style tab.'=>'Nafasi tupu kati ya vizuizi; weka kimo tofauti kwa kila ukubwa wa skrini kwenye kichupo cha Mtindo.','Divider'=>'Kigawanyaji','A horizontal line between sections, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Mstari mlalo kati ya sehemu, uliowekwa mtindo kupitia kichupo cha Mtindo (Style).','Content from another site (a video, a post, a map) by pasting its address.'=>'Maudhui kutoka kwa tovuti nyingine (video, chapisho, ramani) kwa kubandika anwani yake.','Several images in a grid, styled with the Style tab.'=>'Picha kadhaa kwenye gridi, zilizowekwa mtindo kwa kichupo cha Mtindo.','Plain'=>'Kawaida','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Hakuna lugha za kubadilisha. Kibadilishaji huonekana wakati plagiin ya tafsiri inapoonyesha lugha mbili au zaidi.','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishi','Show the current language'=>'Onyesha lugha ya sasa','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Sakinisha Tranzly na uorodheshe lugha mbili au zaidi, na kibadilishaji kitaonekana hapa.','Pills'=>'Vidonge','Dropdown'=>'Kunjuzi','Language codes'=>'Misimbo ya lugha','Show each language as'=>'Onyesha kila lugha kama','Language name'=>'Jina la lugha','Language code'=>'Msimbo wa lugha','Name and code'=>'Jina na msimbo','Flags'=>'Bendera','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguomsingi: bendera inawakilisha nchi, si lugha.','Include the current language'=>'Jumuisha lugha ya sasa','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ficha lugha ambazo ukurasa huu haujatafsiriwa','Stack vertically'=>'Weka wima','Current language text'=>'Maandishi ya lugha ya sasa','Current language background'=>'Mandharinyuma ya lugha ya sasa','Size and spacing'=>'Ukubwa na nafasi','Space between languages'=>'Nafasi kati ya lugha','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Connected (key %s).'=>'Imeunganishwa (ufunguo %s).','API URL'=>'URL ya API','Replace the API key'=>'Badilisha ufunguo wa API','Where to find your %s API key'=>'Mahali pa kupata ufunguo wako wa API wa %s','Check and save'=>'Kagua na uhifadhi','Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block\'s settings → After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.'=>'Unganisha huduma ya orodha ya barua-pepe mara moja; kisha fomu yoyote inaweza kuongeza watu wanaoijaza kwenye mojawapo ya orodha zako (mipangilio ya kizuizi cha fomu → Baada ya kutuma). Vifunguo vinathibitishwa na huduma hiyo, vinahifadhiwa kwa njia fiche kwenye tovuti hii na havitaonyeshwa tena kamwe.','Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a "Conversion event" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.'=>'Tuma mawasilisho ya fomu na mibofyo ya vitufe kwenye uchanganuzi wako bila msimbo wowote. Acha kitambulisho kikiwa tupu ili kuruka huduma hiyo. Vitufe hupata sehemu ya "Tukio la ubadilishaji" katika paneli yake ya Kina. Bango la kuki likiwa limewashwa, hakuna kitakachopakiwa hadi mgeni atakapokubali.','Google Analytics 4 measurement ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kipimo cha Google Analytics 4','Google Tag Manager container ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha kontena ya Google Tag Manager','Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)'=>'Kitambulisho cha Meta Pixel (nambari inayoonyeshwa katika Kidhibiti cha Matukio ya Meta)','Load these tags on my site'=>'Pakia lebo hizi kwenye tovuti yangu','Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.'=>'Zima ikiwa maudhui yako au programu-jalizi nyingine tayari inaziongeza; matukio bado yanatumwa.','Event name for form submissions'=>'Jina la tukio kwa ajili ya mawasilisho ya fomu','The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for "save"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays "denied", and the scripts you list stay switched off.'=>'Bango ni dirisha ibukizi unalounda kwa vizuizi. Vitufe vyake vinaunganisha kwenye #consent-accept, #consent-reject na #consent-save (pamoja na visanduku vya kuteua vinavyoitwa analytics na marketing kwa ajili ya "save"); kiungo cha #consent-open mahali popote hukionyesha tena. Hadi mgeni akubali, lebo za ufuatiliaji hazipakii, Google Consent Mode inasalia "denied", na hati unazoorodhesha zinasalia zimezimwa.','Create a ready-made banner'=>'Tengeneza bango lililotengenezwa tayari','Show a cookie banner'=>'Onyesha bango la kuki','Banner'=>'Bango','Choose a popup…'=>'Chagua dirisha ibukizi…','%s (draft)'=>'%s (rasimu)','Edit the banner'=>'Hariri bango','Remember the choice for (days)'=>'Kumbuka chaguo kwa (siku)','Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no'=>'Nje ya Umoja wa Ulaya, EEA na Uingereza: pakia ufuatiliaji hadi mgeni atakapokataa','Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor\'s country (for example Cloudflare\'s CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.'=>'Imezimwa: kila mgeni lazima akubali kwanza (sheria kali zaidi, na ndiyo chaguomsingi). Imewashwa: pale tu mpangishaji wako au CDN inaporipoti nchi ya mgeni (kwa mfano kijajuu cha CF-IPCountry cha Cloudflare) na iko nje ya EU, EEA, UK na Uswisi. Bango bado linaonyeshwa, na nchi isiyojulikana inachukuliwa kuwa ndani ya EU.','Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)'=>'Hati nyingine za kushikilia hadi idhini ipatikane (handle:analytics au handle:marketing, zikitenganishwa kwa mkato)','Popups, slide-ins and bars'=>'Madirisha ibukizi, vipengele vinavyoteleza na pau','A/B test results'=>'Matokeo ya jaribio la A/B','Guides: forms, popups, motion, tracking, A/B tests and the cookie banner'=>'Miongozo: fomu, madirisha ibukizi, mwendo, ufuatiliaji, majaribio ya A/B na bango la kuki','Mailing-list connections'=>'Muunganisho wa orodha ya barua pepe','Popup settings'=>'Mipangilio ya dirisha ibukizi','Popup (in the middle, page dimmed)'=>'Dirisha ibukizi (katikati, ukurasa umefifishwa)','Slide-in (in a corner)'=>'Kitelezi (kwenye kona)','Bar (top or bottom)'=>'Mwambaa (juu au chini)','Bottom, end side'=>'Chini, upande wa mwisho','Bottom, start side'=>'Chini, upande wa mwanzo','When the page loads'=>'Ukurasa unapopakia','After a delay'=>'Baada ya kuchelewa','After scrolling part of the page'=>'Baada ya kusogeza sehemu ya ukurasa','When the visitor is about to leave'=>'Wakati mgeni anapokaribia kuondoka','When something is clicked'=>'Kitu kinapobonyezwa','Percent of the page'=>'Asilimia ya ukurasa','CSS selector of the element'=>'Kiteuzi cha CSS cha kipengele','How often'=>'Mara ngapi','Every page view'=>'Kila mwonekano wa ukurasa','Once per visit'=>'Mara moja kwa kila ziara','Once every few days'=>'Mara moja kila baada ya siku chache','Until the visitor converts'=>'Hadi mgeni atakapobadilika','Every page'=>'Kila ukurasa','The front page'=>'Ukurasa wa mbele','Chosen pages (IDs)'=>'Kurasa zilizochaguliwa (Vitambulisho)','Chosen content types'=>'Aina za maudhui zilizochaguliwa','Page IDs, comma separated'=>'Vitambulisho vya Kurasa, vimetenganishwa kwa mkato','Content types, comma separated (post, page, product)'=>'Aina za maudhui, zikitenganishwa kwa koma (post, page, product)','Devices'=>'Vifaa','Desktop only'=>'Kompyuta ya mezani pekee','Mobile only'=>'Simu ya mkononi pekee','Close when the dimmed page is clicked'=>'Funga ukurasa uliotiwa giza unapobofywa','Link a button to #popup-close to close the popup, or to #popup-convert to count a conversion.'=>'Unganisha kitufe kwenye #popup-close ili kufunga kidirisha ibukizi, au kwenye #popup-convert ili kuhesabu ubadilishaji.','Conversion event'=>'Tukio la ubadilishaji','Sent to your analytics when this is clicked (for example sign_up). Set up the services under Page Builder Sandwich → Marketing.'=>'Hutumwa kwa uchanganuzi wako wakati hii inapobofya (kwa mfano sign_up). Sanidi huduma zilizo chini ya Page Builder Sandwich → Masoko.','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'Wakala wa AI wanaruhusiwa. Pakia upya ukurasa huu ili kuona zana.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'Wakala wa AI wamezimwa. Anwani yao ya unganisho haijibu tena.','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s pia anahariri ukurasa huu. Kuhifadhi kunaweza kubatilisha mabadiliko yake.','Block library'=>'Maktaba ya vizuizi','Layers'=>'Tabaka','Page canvas'=>'Turubai ya ukurasa','Revisions'=>'Mapitio','Block settings'=>'Mipangilio ya kizuizi','Add block: %s'=>'Ongeza kizuizi: %s','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Fungua katika Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Tengua','Redo'=>'Rudia','Show or hide layers'=>'Onyesha au ficha tabaka','Show or hide the block library'=>'Onyesha au ficha maktaba ya vizuizi','Show revisions'=>'Onyesha masahihisho','Open the normal editor'=>'Fungua kihariri cha kawaida','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Njia za mkato za kibodi','Preview: desktop'=>'Hakiki: eneo-kazi','Preview: tablet'=>'Uhakiki: kishikwambi','Preview: mobile'=>'Hakiki: simu','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Nakili mtindo wa kizuizi kilichochaguliwa','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Bandika mtindo kwenye kizuizi kilichochaguliwa','Copy the selected section'=>'Nakili sehemu iliyochaguliwa','Paste a copied section'=>'Bandika sehemu iliyonakiliwa','Turn off safe mode'=>'Zima hali salama','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Washa hali salama (programu-jalizi nyingine zimezimwa, kwa ajili yako tu, katika Studio pekee)','Scheduled'=>'Imeratibiwa','Pending review'=>'Inasubiri ukaguzi','Private'=>'Kibinafsi','Draft'=>'Rasimu','All changes saved'=>'Mabadiliko yote yamehifadhiwa','Saving…'=>'Inahifadhi…','Autosaving…'=>'Inaihifadhi kiotomatiki…','Unsaved changes'=>'Mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa','autosaved'=>'imehifadhiwa kiotomatiki','Desktop preview'=>'Onyesho la kukagua la kompyuta ya mezani','Tablet preview'=>'Onyesho la kukagua la tableti','Mobile preview'=>'Onyesho la kukagua la simu','%1$s preview (%2$d px)'=>'Uhakiki wa %1$s (%2$d px)','Studio toolbar'=>'Mwambaa wa zana wa Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Rudi kwenye kihariri cha kawaida','Page title'=>'Kichwa cha ukurasa','Preview width'=>'Upana wa onyesho la kukagua','Command palette'=>'Ubao wa amri','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Tazama ukurasa (inafunguka katika kichupo kipya)','Save draft'=>'Hifadhi rasimu','Publish'=>'Chapisha','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Rejesha mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Ukurasa huu una mabadiliko ambayo hayajawahi kuhifadhiwa. Yalihifadhiwa katika kivinjari hiki:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Ukurasa huu una hifadhi ya kiotomatiki mpya zaidi kuliko toleo lililohifadhiwa:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Rejesha mabadiliko ambayo hayajahifadhiwa','Discard'=>'Tupa','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Masahihisho hayakuweza kupakiwa.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Toleo limerejeshwa. Hifadhi ili kuliweka, au tengua ili kurudi nyuma.','Close revisions'=>'Funga masahihisho','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Hakuna masahihisho bado. Kila uhifadhi huunda moja.','Revision from %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Restore this revision'=>'Rejesha marekebisho haya','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kubadilishwa.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Hali salama imewashwa.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'Programu-jalizi nyingine %d imezimwa, kwa ajili yako na katika Sandwich Studio pekee. Tovuti ya moja kwa moja na watumiaji wengine hawajaathiriwa.' . "\0" . 'Programu-jalizi nyingine %d zimezimwa, kwa ajili yako na katika Sandwich Studio pekee. Tovuti ya moja kwa moja na watumiaji wengine hawajaathiriwa.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Hali salama: zima programu-jalizi nyingine katika Studio, kwa ajili yako tu','Save as pattern'=>'Hifadhi kama kielelezo','Synced'=>'Imesawazishwa','Editing the pattern later changes it everywhere it is used.'=>'Kuhariri kiolezo baadaye kutakibadilisha popote kinapotumika.','Each copy can be edited on its own.'=>'Kila nakala inaweza kuhaririwa peke yake.','Save your changes.'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko yako.','Undo your last change.'=>'Tengua mabadiliko yako ya mwisho.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Rudia utendaji wako wa mwisho uliobatilishwa.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Onyesha au ficha kidirisha cha tabaka.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Onyesha njia hizi za mkato za kibodi.','Select a block first.'=>'Chagua kizuizi kwanza.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Mtindo umenakiliwa. Ubandike kwenye kizuizi chochote, kwenye tovuti hii au nyingine.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Kivinjari kimekataa kunakili.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Sehemu imenakiliwa. Bandika kwenye ukurasa wowote, kwenye tovuti hii au nyingine.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Ubao wa kunakili hauna mtindo ulionakiliwa kutoka Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Mtindo umebandikwa kwenye kizuizi %d.' . "